      title: "rickcreates.com"
    }
    summary: "**longhoang-lyo.com** is the award-winning personal creative portfolio of **Long Hoang (Lyo)**, a product designer and creative developer based in Hanoi, Vietnam[1][2]. \n\nLaunched after over a year and 2,300+ hours of solo development[3][1], the site functions as an **interactive 3D tank game** rather than a traditional resume[1]. \n\nKey highlights of the portfolio include:\n* **The Gameplay & World:** Visitors drive a small neon-green tank starting from a tutorial hill into a comic-style cartoon factory[1]. Along the way, you can fight enemies, collect parts, and explore[1]. Inside a central machine within the factory, visitors can discover his featured projects[1]. \n* **Visual Style:** The entire 3D world is styled like a comic book\342\200\224complete with halftone dots, cross-hatching, heavy outlines, and trembling, torn-paper UI panels[1].\n* **Tech Stack:** Built using **Three.js** and **GSAP**[3][4]. It leverages Three.js\'s node-based shading language for customized toon materials and outlines[5], while ensuring robust cross-device compatibility by running primarily through WebGL (while utilizing modern GPU-focused pipelines)[5].\n* **Accessibility:** For visitors short on time, a quick-access button at the bottom of the screen allows users to bypass the game and skip straight to his portfolio works[1]. \n\nThe project has received widespread acclaim in the creative coding community, including features like **FWA of the Day**[1].\n\nSources:\n[1] [rickcreates.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQF5j2gnybHt-6Gn_fuxMn66HrOuuQxvj6JPKPcz8uKY9GLhM1j5RkSxgv_b0k_MjgkzB5IApQtR9tkxegvWVOvI3m7SG0a6RnGi1LozJ2X-xuWpGgYCo2EmBxg9V_FcZNjm00QXnxrNmWhZzqlXMxE=)\n[2] [longhoang-lyo.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFqtqW5UazE7byGiNO4y87lrVy_Qp_5O3WOLuYRp-HavnTUiHNjYHU0m7G023C-dnZP3mj0V92jKyRrN8xrGJgxllD1OZ1hWr_VN9Y0fkPXRA==)\n[3] [threejs.org](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFar8WoHA5O-nllSP6CeiBL1zC1UjdFtHkalRfL8lkgWAn9w7_hS11CbvMvnZFGn4D7FilxXo1v0Tf8w_yoiLE1UMBJFMLk8ErZPNwn0K9UqxOlVVsI_Z9SxnArOUeWZyfuBbmnNs8lb89aiDCqoBCTtjT27pXb25ZMi9j1jg==)\n[4] [webgpu.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQESX-om_GzGaBGnqJSYXO7iIGJNXAhGt6zVWOEp89dvu67WSIwgX0qauj61fNx_akkkOqV_eIcJm95WEOzK14Khbw0BBpkvm7Dk3HA6kQtkUkxnaeKXBTz7y7EL1f7Q)\n[5] [rickcreates.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQF5j2gnybHt-6Gn_fuxMn66HrOuuQxvj6JPKPcz8uKY9GLhM1j5RkSxgv_b0k_MjgkzB5IApQtR9tkxegvWVOvI3m7SG0a6RnGi1LozJ2X-xuWpGgYCo2EmBxg9V_FcZNjm00QXnxrNmWhZzqlXMxE=)"
