  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Formulating Verification Plan**\n\nOkay, I\'m currently focused on creating the verification plan, as per the `ultra-mode` guidelines. The initial strategy involves a staged approach for installing `three` and `@types/three` using `install_applet_package`, and updating both `/metadata.json` and `/index.html` in tandem. This will be the foundational stage.\n\n\n**Defining Interactive Layout**\n\nI am now visualizing the interactive layout as described. My focus is now on the title screen experience and how it sets the stage. I must ensure the tank centerpiece on the right is visually compelling with cursor tracking, while the \"LYOOO PORTFOLIO\" SVG lockup and \"LET\'S GO\" button on the left are properly integrated. The main concern is ensuring the state changes seamlessly from title screen to gameplay, specifically when the \"LET\'S GO\" button is clicked.\n\n\n**Outlining Gameplay Mechanics**\n\nI\'m now outlining the gameplay mechanics, focusing on the interactive elements. I\'m aiming the turret with the mouse and verifying cannon firing, specifically testing Space/click for cannon fire at targets like Explosive Barrels, Hydrants, and Enemy Robots. I will also be verifying HUD updates for score, items, and HP, as well as grab mode toggling and lighting cycles, and the pause modal. The goal is to fully define the interactive canvas experience.\n\n\n"
