  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Analyzing Visuals: Screen**\n\nI\'ve been examining the initial screenshot, specifically the graphic elements. The hexagon/polygon cutout above the tank on the crosswalk is interesting. Also notable are the \"LYOOO PORTFOLIO\" comic sticker, the muted speaker symbol, and the tilted \"LET\'S GO\" button, all contributing to the visual language.\n\n\n**Refining Tank Aesthetics**\n\nI\'m now zeroing in on the tank\'s visual representation. The current rendering has a washout issue when using `ACESFilmicToneMapping` with bright directional light. I\'m considering `THREE.MeshToonMaterial` to give the tank more comic-like cel-shading with a `DataTexture` and a richer neon lime. This approach aims for crisp high-contrast shadows.\n\n\n"
