  checkpoint {
    session_summary: "<summary>\n1. **Task Overview**\n   - **Core Request**: Reverse-engineer, extract, and analyze the source code, JavaScript/WebGPU bundles, 3D asset hierarchy, Rapier physics parameters, and TSL shaders from `https://longhoang-lyo.com/` (\"LYOOO PORTFOLIO / Factory Playground\"), and port the experience so it works both as a live interactive 3D game in this web app (via the attached `Create a game` feature chip) AND as a complete 1:1 Roblox Studio (Luau) project.\n   - **Required Deliverables**:\n     1. **Interactive 3D WebGL Game Clone**: Full-viewport \"LYOOO PORTFOLIO / Factory Playground\" experience with the right-side Hexagon/Polygon viewport cutout on the Title Screen, comic-style \"LYOOO PORTFOLIO\" sticker typography, tilted neon-green `\"LET\'S GO\"` (`data-start=\"true\"`) button, polygon audio mute button, 11-part cel-shaded neon-green Tank (`#b8ff3c` / `#9ef01a`) with hard ink outlines (`#17110f`), critically-damped follow camera, cannon recoil, `[G]` Telekinesis Grab Mode, Day/Dusk/Night/Dawn lighting presets, cartoon puff smoke on manholes/chimneys, destructible explosive barrels, fire hydrants, collectibles (`GEAR`, `TOOLS`, `CIRCUIT`, `FUEL`), Power Core monument, and 3 distinct Enemy Robot archetypes (`chaser`, `kiter`, `boss`) with windup telegraphs.\n     2. **Laporan Hasil REA (Stage 1)** & **Kode Luau Lengkap & Siap Pakai (Stage 2)** accessible both in-app (via the REA & Luau Suite modal) and in the final response:\n        - `StarterPlayerScripts/IsometricCamera.client.lua`\n        - `ServerScriptService/TankBuilder.server.lua` & `StarterPlayerScripts/TankController.client.lua`\n        - `ServerScriptService/LightingSetup.server.lua`\n        - `StarterGui/LyoooPortfolioUI.client.lua`\n\n2. **Progress**\n   - **Skills & References Read**:\n     - `/skills/system_skills/ultra_mode/SKILL.md`\n     - `/skills/system_skills/ultra_mode/references/game_title_and_hud.md`\n     - `/skills/system_skills/ultra_mode/references/games_3d.md`\n     - `/skills/system_skills/threejs/SKILL.md`, `references/fundamentals.md`, `references/materials.md`\n     - `/skills/system_skills/computer_use/SKILL.md`\n     - `/skills/system_skills/frontend_design/SKILL.md`, `references/5_threejs_3d_spatial.md`\n   - **Target Site Extraction Completed (`/tmp/rea_lyo/`)**:\n     - Downloaded and analyzed production bundles from `https://longhoang-lyo.com/`: `CQl67Veh.js` (Camera), `B1Nq4Kq6.js` (World, Robot `sr`, PhysicsWorld `cr`, RobotControl `ur`, BulletSystem `ci`, GrabMode `fi`, WorldMaterial `Yn`, StrokeMaterial `Nn`, DayNightCycle `Di`, ChimneySmoke `Ji`), `BlAypStk.js` (Asset manifest & bootstrapper), `CJn-Xu8f.js` (Intro UI & Hexagon mask), `t1WzwXnd.js` (UI copy), and `BcJjgNcx.css` (Theme palette).\n   - **Completed & Verified Files**:\n     - `/package.json`: Installed `three` and `@types/three` via `install_applet_package`.\n     - `/metadata.json` & `/index.html`: Synced title and description (`LYOOO Factory Playground \342\200\224 WebGPU/Three.js & Roblox Luau Port`), loaded Google Fonts (`Barlow` and `JetBrains Mono`).\n     - `/src/index.css`: Configured theme CSS variables and comic sticker shadow utilities.\n     - `/src/game/rules.ts`: Implemented pure math and extracted REA constants (`REA_CONSTANTS`, `LIGHTING_PRESETS`, `stepCriticalDampedSpring3D`, `computeTankSpeedStep`, `stepTurretYaw`, `isPowerCoreReady`).\n     - `/src/game/rules.test.ts`: Created 5 unit tests covering REA constants, tank speed/boost, critically damped camera spring, turret yaw slerp, and Power Core activation. Ran `npx --yes tsx --test src/game/rules.test.ts` -> **5/5 passing**.\n     - `/src/data/reaAndLuauData.ts`: Complete REA report data + all 4 complete, untruncated Roblox Studio Luau scripts (`IsometricCamera.client.lua`, `TankBuilder.server.lua` + `TankController.client.lua`, `LightingSetup.server.lua`, `LyoooPortfolioUI.client.lua`).\n     - `/src/game/audio.ts`: Procedural Web Audio API synthesizer.\n     - `/src/components/ReaLuauModal.tsx`: Interactive modal displaying the REA Extraction Report, Roblox Explorer hierarchy, and 1-click Copy/Download `.lua` buttons for all 4 Luau scripts.\n     - `/src/game/FactoryPlaygroundCanvas.tsx`: Full Three.js 3D game viewport with software-WebGL guard (`isSoftwareGl`, `afterDraw`), 3-step `MeshToonMaterial` cel-shading, `#17110f` `BackSide` ink outlines, 11-part Tank rig, cartoon puff smoke ring buffer, explosive barrels, hydrants, crates, `[G]` Grab Mode curved spring laser, collectibles, Power Core, and 3 enemy archetypes.\n     - `/src/App.tsx`: Full Game Shell (`\'title\'`, `\'playing\'`, `\'paused\'`, `\'gameover\'`), `?autostart=1` support, SVG Hexagon cutout mask, inline `<svg>` \"LYOOO PORTFOLIO\" comic sticker lockup, and world-matched HUD.\n   - **Verification Round 1 Completed & Critiqued**:\n     - Ran unit tests (`5/5 pass`), `compile_applet` (`Build succeeded`), `restart_dev_server`, and `playwright-cli` captures (`r1-title.png`, `r1-playing.png`, `r1-rea-modal.png`) with `0` console errors and `0` warnings.\n     - Inspected all 3 screenshots via `view_file` and applied 3 targeted polish edits in `/src/components/ReaLuauModal.tsx` (wrapped tab bar so the 5th tab is never clipped) and `/src/game/FactoryPlaygroundCanvas.tsx` (upgraded Tank and prop materials to 3-step `MeshToonMaterial` with `NearestFilter` `DataTexture` gradient map for richer neon-green `#9ef01a` / `#b8ff3c` cel-shading, and placed barrels/manholes/crates closer to the spawn vista).\n   - **Pending Verification of Last Edits**:\n     - The last two edits to `/src/components/ReaLuauModal.tsx` and `/src/game/FactoryPlaygroundCanvas.tsx` have been written to disk, and now require a final post-edit verification pass (`npx --yes tsx --test src/game/rules.test.ts`, `compile_applet`, `restart_dev_server`, and Round 2 `playwright-cli` capture) before concluding the turn.\n\n3. **Key Findings (Extracted from `longhoang-lyo.com`)**\n   - **Camera (`CQl67Veh.js`)**: `PerspectiveCamera(35, aspect, 0.1, 1000)`, default offset `Vector3(4, 14, 8)`, `playerStart: Vector3(0, 2, 14)`, zoom `{ minDistance: 9, amplitude: 12, value: 0.6 }` (`16.2m`), critically-damped spring `smoothTime = lerp(0.18, 0.22, speedAlpha)`, `omega = 2 / smoothTime`, `mousePanSensitivity = 1.3`, `mousePanDampSpeed = 5`, `recoilKickDistance = 0.13`, `maxRecoilDistance = 0.37`, `playerStartPosition = (57.334, 10.068, 98.584)`.\n   - **Physics (`B1Nq4Kq6.js`)**: Rapier gravity `(0, -9.81, 0)`, `fixedTimeStep = 1/60`, Tank `linearDamping = 0.5`, `angularDamping = 0.8`, cuboid collider `friction = 0.3`, `restitution = 0.4`, `speed = 8.0`, `boostSpeed = 1.9` (`15.2`), `rotationSpeed = 3.12`, `rotationLerpRate = 50`, `forwardFrictionFactor = 0.5`, `lateralFrictionFactor = 20`, `turretDamping = 0.06` (`* 60 = 3.6`), `projectileSpeed = 55`, `fireRate = 0.2`, `recoilDistance = 0.16`, Grab Mode `[G]` `holdingDistance = 6`, `springStrength = 180`, `damping = 16`.\n   - **Shaders & Lighting (`Yn`, `Nn`, `Di`, `Ji`)**: Inverted-hull outline `strokeWidth = 0.018`, `strokeMaxDepth = 1.5`, `strokeColor = #17110f` (RGB `23, 17, 15`), 45\302\260 UV cross-hatching (`0.7854` rad, freq `204`), Key Light `#ffe8d6` intensity `2.0` at `(2, 25, -2)`, Day/Dusk/Night/Dawn 365s cycle, Chimney/Manhole puff smoke (`velY = 1.28..1.92`, `lifetime = 5.5..8.5s`, `scale = 0.14..0.24 -> 0.9..1.4`, `peakOpacity = 0.72..0.92`).\n   - **Intro UI (`CJn-Xu8f.js` & `BcJjgNcx.css`)**: Polygon cutout path `M165.38 1.02246L1.03955 130.303L18.744 351.961L165.38 480.474L359.797 463.998L468.628 351.961L498.16 191.008L394.397 15.8505L165.38 1.02246Z` (`viewBox=\"0 0 500 482\"`), brand palette `--palette-brand-10: #beef74`, `--palette-brand-20: #c7ff72`, neon lime `#b8ff3c` / `#b4ff39`, dark ink `#11121a`.\n\n4. **Errors & Fixes**\n   - No build, runtime, or unit test failures occurred.\n   - Visual critique after Round 1 identified 3 visual polish items (washed-out PBR tank hue under ACESFilmic tone mapping, distant props in initial spawn frame, and slight right-edge clipping of the 5th tab in `ReaLuauModal.tsx`). All 3 were fixed via `replace_file_content` in `/src/components/ReaLuauModal.tsx` and `/src/game/FactoryPlaygroundCanvas.tsx`.\n\n5. **Active Context**\n   - Dev server is running on port 3000 (`DISABLE_HMR=true`, so `restart_dev_server` is required after the latest edits).\n   - All temporary downloaded target bundles reside in `/tmp/rea_lyo/` outside `/app/applet`, so the workspace is clean.\n\n6. **Next Steps**\n   1. Run `npx --yes tsx --test src/game/rules.test.ts` and `compile_applet` to verify the latest edits compile cleanly and pass all tests.\n   2. Call `restart_dev_server` so the dev server serves the updated build.\n   3. Run Verification Round 2 with `playwright-cli` (`trap \'playwright-cli close\' EXIT`), capturing `r2-title.png`, `r2-playing.png`, and `r2-rea-modal.png`, and view them with `view_file` to confirm the 3-step cel-shaded Tank, enriched spawn vista, and unclipped 5-tab REA/Luau modal.\n   4. Present the complete response in Indonesian containing:\n      - **Bagian 1: Laporan Hasil REA (`https://longhoang-lyo.com/`)** (konstanta matematika kamera, fisika Rapier, TSL shader & palet warna hex, serta daftar aset `.glb`/`.ktx2`).\n      - **Bagian 2: Panduan Struktur Explorer Roblox Studio & Kode Lengkap 4 Script Luau** (`IsometricCamera.client.lua`, `TankBuilder.server.lua` & `TankController.client.lua`, `LightingSetup.server.lua`, `LyoooPortfolioUI.client.lua`) secara utuh tanpa placeholder.\n\n7. **Commitments & Constraints**\n   - Per `ultra-mode`, every code edit must be followed by unit tests (`npx --yes tsx --test`), `compile_applet`, `restart_dev_server`, and a browser capture that is read with `view_file` before finishing.\n   - Always close `playwright-cli` (`trap \'playwright-cli close\' EXIT`) and never overwrite previously read screenshot filenames (use `r2-*.png`).\n</summary>"
