    thinking: "**Adding GDD Tabs**\n\nI\'m currently integrating the \"BUDDY BLITZ: Crate Warfare (GDD 4 Fase)\" tabs into `/src/components/ReaLuauModal.tsx`. Right now, I\'m focusing on incorporating the individual phases: `Fase 1: Arena & Kamera`, `Fase 2: Stacking Pad`, `Fase 3: Tank & Senjata`, and `Fase 4: AI`, which should be a seamless experience.\n\n\n"
