  checkpoint {
    checkpoint_index: 1
    session_summary: "<summary>\n1. **Task Overview**\n   - **Core Request**: Overhaul the 3D gameplay in `/src/game/FactoryPlaygroundCanvas.tsx` and `/src/App.tsx` (and keep it synced with the 4-Phase Roblox Studio Luau scripts in `/src/data/buddyBlitzLuauSuite.ts`) so that the web application is a **true 3D Team Buddies x Long Hoang (Lyo) game** (\"BUDDY BLITZ: Crate Warfare\") rather than just UI buttons over a dark tank floor.\n   - **5 Mandatory 3D Gameplay Requirements**:\n     1. **Pemain Utama Adalah Karakter \"Buddy\" (Chibi/Blocky Character), BUKAN Langsung Tank**: Player starts on foot controlling a cel-shaded, black-outlined Blocky/Chibi Roblox Buddy avatar with animated running arms/legs (`WASD`), rotating toward the mouse crosshair, shooting (`Left Click` / `Space`), and carrying crates.\n     2. **Siklus Fisik \"Ambil Peti -> Angkut di Atas Kepala -> Lempar ke Stacking Pad 2x2x2\" di Dunia 3D**: Remove fake UI crate-adding buttons; instead drop physical 3D **Red Crates (`#ff3b30`)** and **Blue Super Crates (`#00d2ff`)** with 3D white **parachutes** and landing **Squash & Stretch** into the Central & Side Drop Zones. Pressing `[E]` near a crate lifts the 3D crate **directly above the character\'s head** (both arms raised holding the crate). Pressing `[E]` near the 3D **Stacking Pad 2x2x2** throws/snaps the crate into the physical 8-slot `2x2x2` grid on the pad with a floating 3D **Hologram Recipe Preview Sign**.\n     3. **Tendang Tumpukan (`[F]`) untuk Melahirkan Senjata, AI Buddy, atau Tank Lyo**: Pressing `[F]` near the 3D Stacking Pad breaks the stacked crates and spawns the real 3D object next to the pad:\n        - `1x1x1` (1 crate) -> 3D Weapon Pickup (`Uzi / Ice Gun` or `Laser Rifle`).\n        - `1x1x2` (2 vertical) / `2x1x2` (4 vertical) -> Living **3D AI Buddy** (`Infuntry`, `Ninja`, `Medic`, `Commando`, `Cyborg`, `Stealthy`, `SuperBuddie`) that automatically runs to the Drop Zone, carries crates overhead back to the Blue Stacking Pad, and fights Red Team enemies.\n        - `2x2x1` (4 flat) -> 3D Heavy Weapon (`Bazooka` / `Supazooka`).\n        - `2x2x2` (8 full cube) -> 3D **Lyo Tank** (or Dual-Cannon **Super Tyrant Tank** if a Blue Super Crate was in the stack).\n     4. **Mekanik Mount / Dismount Tank (`[G]`) \342\200\224 Open-Top Turret Rider**: Tanks in the 3D world only move when mounted. Walking near a Tank and pressing `[G]` mounts the character into the turret hatch so the **upper body and chibi head protrude from the top of the turret (Open-Top Rider)** and rotate 360\302\260 with the cannon aim. Driving over loose crates in the tank collects up to 4 crates (`Crate Run-Over`) and auto-unloads them onto the Stacking Pad. Pressing `[G]` again dismounts back into the on-foot Buddy character.\n     5. **Padang Rumput Siang Hari Lyo + 2 Markas**: Bright green grass ground (`#5ec932`), warm dirt roads (`#d89c60` with `#c28348` borders), 280 wind-swaying 3D grass blades (`#6cd938`, 4-bucket time-sliced), destructible stylized Lyo trees (brown trunk `#8c4a27`, blue-purple canopy `#1d1f8c` that drop Power-Ups when destroyed), and **Blue HQ vs Red HQ (2000 HP each)** with AI enemies harvesting crates and attacking.\n\n2. **Progress**\n   - **Completed & Verified Earlier**:\n     - `/src/game/audio.ts`: Added `playPowerCore()` method to `SoundEngine` to fix the earlier `TypeError: soundEngine.playPowerCore is not a function` error.\n     - `/src/game/rules.ts`: Added `BuildOrderTarget` (`\'AUTO\' | \'1x1x1\' | \'1x1x2\' | \'2x2x1\' | \'2x1x2\' | \'2x2x2\'`) and `chooseNextPadSlotIndex(slots, buildOrder)` alongside `evaluateStackingPadRecipe`, `BUDDY_CLASSES`, and `LYO_ARENA_PALETTE`.\n     - `/src/game/rules.test.ts`: Added unit test `#8` (`chooseNextPadSlotIndex places vertical 1x1x2 and flat 2x2x1 stacks accurately`).\n     - `/src/data/buddyBlitzLuauSuite.ts` & `/src/components/ReaLuauModal.tsx`: Complete 4-Phase Roblox Studio Luau scripts (`Phase1_LyoArenaBuilder.server.lua`, `WindGrassAndVFX.client.lua`, `LyoCameraAndCrosshair.client.lua`, `CrateRecipes.lua`, `Phase2_CrateStackingSystem.server.lua`, `Phase3_VehicleAndCombat.server.lua`, `BuddyClasses.lua`, `Phase4_AISquadAndGameModes.server.lua`, `LyoComicHUD.client.lua`).\n   - **Completed Code Edits (Pending Final Verification Pass)**:\n     - `/src/game/FactoryPlaygroundCanvas.tsx`: Completely rewritten to implement all 5 mandatory 3D Team Buddies x Lyo features:\n       - Lyo bright green meadow (`#5ec932`), warm dirt roads (`#d89c60` / `#c28348`), Central & Side Drop Zones, 280 time-sliced wind-swaying 3D grass blades (`#6cd938`), destructible blue-purple canopy Lyo trees (`#1d1f8c`), and Blue HQ vs Red HQ (`2000 HP`) with 3D Billboard signs.\n       - Physical 3D `2x2x2` Stacking Pads (`8` 3D crate slot meshes + `Merged Crates` wireframe cage + dynamic 3D Hologram Recipe Preview Sign).\n       - On-foot Chibi/Blocky Player Buddy + Allied & Enemy AI Buddies with animated legs/arms, overhead 3D crate carrying (`carryingCrate`), and weapon firing (`Ice Gun` freeze+shatter, `Bazooka`, `Uzi`, `Katana`).\n       - Parachute 3D Crate spawner (`Red` & `Super` crates) with Squash & Stretch landing, `[E]` pickup/overhead carry/throw to Pad, `[F]` kick/craft on Pad (spawning 3D weapons, living AI Buddies, or Lyo/Tyrant Tanks), `[G]` Mount/Dismount Open-Top Tank with protruding turret rider & 4-crate run-over harvesting, `[Q]` Build Order, `[V]` Squad Command, and `[Tab]` Buddy Swap.\n     - `/src/App.tsx`: Updated to bind HUD and bottom action dock directly to the 3D world state and `CustomEvent(\'buddy-action\')` dispatches.\n\n3. **Key Findings**\n   - In headless Chromium (`SwiftShader`), `isSoftwareGl` detection keeps frame times fast by disabling expensive shadow map passes while preserving 3-step `MeshToonMaterial` cel-shading and `BackSide` `#12121e` ink outlines.\n   - `chooseNextPadSlotIndex` ensures that in `AUTO` or `1x1x2` mode, the 1st crate goes to slot `0` (bottom-left) and the 2nd crate goes to slot `4` (top-left directly above slot `0`), so 2 crates immediately form a vertical `1x1x2` stack to craft a new 3D AI Buddy (while `2x2x1` fills bottom slots `0..3` for Heavy Weapons and `2x2x2` fills all 8 slots for a Tank).\n\n4. **Errors & Fixes**\n   - **Resolved**: `TypeError: soundEngine.playPowerCore is not a function` in `/src/App.tsx` when clicking the craft button \342\200\224 fixed by adding `public playPowerCore(): void { this.playVictory(); }` to `SoundEngine` in `/src/game/audio.ts` and verified in Playwright with `0` console errors.\n\n5. **Active Context**\n   - `/src/game/FactoryPlaygroundCanvas.tsx` and `/src/App.tsx` have just been written to disk.\n   - `DISABLE_HMR=true` is active in this environment, so `restart_dev_server` must be called after compiling so the dev server on port 3000 serves the new build.\n\n6. **Next Steps**\n   1. Run the unit test suite (`npx --yes tsx --test src/game/rules.test.ts`) and `compile_applet` to verify that `/src/game/FactoryPlaygroundCanvas.tsx`, `/src/App.tsx`, and `/src/game/rules.ts` compile cleanly with all 8 unit tests passing.\n   2. Call `restart_dev_server` so port 3000 serves the updated 3D Team Buddies x Lyo game.\n   3. Run a `playwright-cli` verification session (`trap \'playwright-cli close\' EXIT`) at `http://localhost:3000?autostart=1`:\n      - Capture a screenshot of the on-foot Chibi Buddy on the Lyo green meadow next to the Blue Stacking Pad 2x2x2, crates, and parked Lyo Tank (`r5-buddy-onfoot.png`).\n      - Test pressing `e` (pickup crate overhead / throw to pad), `f` (craft from Stacking Pad), and `g` (mount into the Open-Top Tank turret rider), and capture a second screenshot (`r5-open-top-tank.png`).\n      - Check `playwright-cli console error` to confirm `0` errors.\n      - Inspect both screenshots with `view_file` (`AbsolutePath: \"/r5-buddy-onfoot.png\"` and `\"/r5-open-top-tank.png\"`), then remove temporary screenshot files (`rm -rf r5-*.png .playwright-cli`).\n   4. Present a clear summary of the 5 completed 3D gameplay upgrades and controls to the user.\n\n7. **Commitments & Constraints**\n   - Follow `ultra-mode` verification discipline: always run unit tests, `compile_applet`, `restart_dev_server`, and inspect real browser screenshots via `view_file` before finishing.\n   - Obey `<additional_user_instructions>` for clean, concise UI text (no emojis, no unrequested icons, concise labels).\n</summary>"
