    content: "- generic [active] [ref=e1]:\n  - generic:\n    - img \"LYOOO PORTFOLIO\"\n    - generic [ref=e3]:\n      - paragraph [ref=e5]: PREPARING RENDERER...\n      - progressbar \"PREPARING RENDERER...\" [ref=e9]\n  - main \"3D Interactive Portfolio Application\":\n    - heading \"Long Hoang (Lyo) \342\200\223 Designer & Developer\" [level=1] [ref=e13]\n    - region \"Portfolio Summary and Index\" [ref=e14]:\n      - generic [ref=e15]:\n        - heading \"Long Hoang (Lyo)\" [level=2] [ref=e16]\n        - paragraph [ref=e17]: Designer and Developer based in Hanoi, Vietnam. Specialized in 3D WebGL experiences, interactive game design, UI/UX architecture, and frontend engineering.\n        - navigation \"Primary site navigation\" [ref=e18]:\n          - list [ref=e19]:\n            - listitem [ref=e20]:\n              - link \"Home\" [ref=e21] [cursor=pointer]:\n                - /url: /\n            - listitem [ref=e22]:\n              - link \"Work\" [ref=e23] [cursor=pointer]:\n                - /url: /work\n            - listitem [ref=e24]:\n              - link \"About\" [ref=e25] [cursor=pointer]:\n                - /url: /about\n            - listitem [ref=e26]:\n              - link \"Contact\" [ref=e27] [cursor=pointer]:\n                - /url: /contact\n      - region \"Work\" [ref=e28]:\n        - heading [level=2] [ref=e29]:\n          - link \"Work\" [ref=e30] [cursor=pointer]:\n            - /url: /work\n        - paragraph [ref=e31]: Selected work, design systems, and digital product case studies including Hanzii Dict, Mazii, Todaii, and Niubii.\n        - list [ref=e32]:\n          - listitem [ref=e33]:\n            - article [ref=e34]:\n              - heading [level=3] [ref=e35]:\n                - link \"Hanzii Dict - Smart Chinese Learning Superapp\" [ref=e36] [cursor=pointer]:\n                  - /url: /work/hanzii\n              - paragraph [ref=e37]: Product Design and Gamified Learning Experience serving over 5,000,000 global language learners with AI HSK preparation and character recognition.\n          - listitem [ref=e38]:\n            - article [ref=e39]:\n              - heading [level=3] [ref=e40]:\n                - link \"Mazii - Japanese Dictionary & Learning Ecosystem\" [ref=e41] [cursor=pointer]:\n                  - /url: /work/mazii\n              - paragraph [ref=e42]: Design Systems and UX overhaul for the world\'s leading Japanese learning platform with 10M+ community members.\n          - listitem [ref=e43]:\n            - article [ref=e44]:\n              - heading [level=3] [ref=e45]:\n                - link \"Todaii - German Language Learning\" [ref=e46] [cursor=pointer]:\n                  - /url: /work/todaii\n              - paragraph [ref=e47]: German language learning app with AI conversations, verb practice, and Goethe mock tests.\n          - listitem [ref=e48]:\n            - article [ref=e49]:\n              - heading \"Todaii - Learn Japanese with News\" [level=3] [ref=e50]\n              - paragraph [ref=e51]: Learn Japanese through news, reading, and listening.\n          - listitem [ref=e52]:\n            - article [ref=e53]:\n              - heading [level=3] [ref=e54]:\n                - link \"Niubii - Conversational Language Learning\" [ref=e55] [cursor=pointer]:\n                  - /url: /work/niubii\n              - paragraph [ref=e56]: Interactive bite-sized situational language dialogue and pronunciation evaluation product.\n      - region \"About\" [ref=e57]:\n        - heading [level=2] [ref=e58]:\n          - link \"About\" [ref=e59] [cursor=pointer]:\n            - /url: /about\n        - paragraph [ref=e60]: Product designer and developer with nearly 5 years in EdTech and smart home, one failed startup alongside incredible people, and a fresh commitment to breaking out of my comfort zone to push interactive 3D WebGL experiences.\n      - region \"Contact\" [ref=e61]:\n        - heading [level=2] [ref=e62]:\n          - link \"Contact\" [ref=e63] [cursor=pointer]:\n            - /url: /contact\n        - paragraph [ref=e64]: Let\'s collaborate and make good things together. Available for creative development, 3D WebGL experiences, and product design inquiries.\n        - paragraph [ref=e65]:\n          - text: \"Connect:\"\n          - link \"Send Message\" [ref=e66] [cursor=pointer]:\n            - /url: /contact\n          - text: or email\n          - link \"longhoang.0816@gmail.com\" [ref=e67] [cursor=pointer]:\n            - /url: mailto:longhoang.0816@gmail.com\n          - text: .\n      - heading \"Core Technology Stack & Principles\" [level=2] [ref=e68]\n      - paragraph [ref=e69]: Crafting high-performance digital experiences utilizing Three.js, WebGPU, Rapier physics, GSAP, TSL shaders, and semantic accessible web standards.\n    - img \"3D Interactive Portfolio World featuring interactive projects, characters, and environment\" [ref=e70]"
