            lines {
              text: "  - Jarak zoom: `zoom = { minDistance: 9, amplitude: 12, value: 0.6 }` -> jarak kamera default `9 + 12 * 0.6 = 16.2` meter di sepanjang vektor `(4, 14, 8)`."
