              text: "### C. Hard Ink Outline (`Nn` / `StrokeManager` di `B1Nq4Kq6.js:1500\342\200\2235600, 461000\342\200\223464000`)"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
