  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Defining Asset Loading**\n\nI\'m currently focused on designing a robust `/src/game/lyoAssetsAndShaders.ts` module to handle asset loading. The core will be an `LyoAssetRegistry` leveraging `GLTFLoader`, `DRACOLoader`, and `KTX2Loader`. Right now, I\'m working to make the module clean and modular.\n\n\n**Implementing Asset Loading**\n\nI\'ve made progress on the `LyoAssetRegistry`. It\'s now preloading `.glb` assets, including the player tank (`player.glb` and its track data) and various environment assets. I\'m also ensuring the correct loaders, like `DRACOLoader` and `KTX2Loader`, are correctly integrated with the `GLTFLoader`.  I\'m focusing on efficiency and modularity.\n\n\n**Optimizing Terrain Shading**\n\nI\'m now integrating cross-hatching and terrain light bounce into the shader. I\'m configuring the `bounceColor`, shadow steps, highlight steps, shadow colors, light colors and direction to achieve the desired look. I\'m preserving the `baseColorTexture` from the `.glb` meshes. Next, I am attaching a LyoModelStroke to the scene.\n\n\n\n**Constructing Grass and Trees**\n\nI\'m now implementing the `InfiniteGrass` shader, using instanced attributes, Perlin noise, and deterministic hashing for precise placement.  I\'ve got the exact colors and wind effects, including toroidal wrapping and radial bending. I am working on the exact shader material for the infinite grass, including petals. Furthermore, I am extracting the real trunk mesh from `Tree_1B.REF` and implementing the `buildRealLyoTreeFromGlb` function.\n\n\n**Building Tree Foliage**\n\nI\'m now focusing on generating the tree foliage. Specifically, I am creating 80-card spherical clusters for the foliage with billboard and wind sway shaders, utilizing the `tree-foliage.ktx2` alpha cutout. The colors are adjusted based on the specific tree variant.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_218260"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"CodeContent\":\"import * as THREE from \'three\';\\nimport { GLTFLoader, GLTF } from \'three/addons/loaders/GLTFLoader.js\';\\nimport { DRACOLoader } from \'three/addons/loaders/DRACOLoader.js\';\\nimport { KTX2Loader } from \'three/addons/loaders/KTX2Loader.js\';\\nimport { mergeGeometries, mergeVertices } from \'three/addons/utils/BufferGeometryUtils.js\';\\n\\nexport interface LyoWindUniforms {\\n  uTime: { value: number };\\n  uWindPhase: { value: number };\\n  uWindDirection: { value: THREE.Vector2 };\\n  uWindStrength: { value: number };\\n  uWindGust: { value: number };\\n  uLightDirection: { value: THREE.Vector3 };\\n  uLightColor: { value: THREE.Color };\\n  uShadowColor: { value: THREE.Color };\\n}\\n\\n/**\\n * Exact spherical directional light direction from Lyo\'s Oi (LightingManager):\\n * radius = 50, phi = 0.63, theta = 0.72\\n */\\nexport function getLyoDefaultLightDirection(): THREE.Vector3 {\\n  const spherical = new THREE.Spherical(50, 0.63, 0.72);\\n  return new THREE.Vector3().setFromSpherical(spherical).normalize();\\n}\\n\\n/**\\n * Exact 128x128 3-octave Perlin noise texture from Lyo\'s Ni.prototype.initWindNoiseTexture (B1Nq4Kq6.js:407200)\\n */\\nexport function createLyoWindNoiseTexture(): THREE.CanvasTexture {\\n  const canvas = document.createElement(\'canvas\');\\n  canvas.width = 128;\\n  canvas.height = 128;\\n  const ctx = canvas.getContext(\'2d\')!;\\n  const imgData = ctx.createImageData(128, 128);\\n  const data = imgData.data;\\n\\n  // Deterministic seed table so wind waves are reproducible\\n  const table: number[] = [];\\n  let s = 1337420;\\n  for (let i = 0; i < 256; i++) {\\n    s = (s * 1664525 + 1013904223) >>> 0;\\n    table.push(s / 4294967296);\\n  }\\n  const sampleGrid = (x: number, y: number) => {\\n    const gx = ((x % 16) + 16) % 16;\\n    const gy = ((y % 16) + 16) % 16;\\n    return table[gy * 16 + gx];\\n  };\\n  const lerp = (a: number, b: number, t: number) => a + (b - a) * t;\\n  const fade = (t: number) => t * t * t * (t * (t * 6 - 15) + 10);\\n  const noise2D = (x: number, y: number) => {\\n    const ix = Math.floor(x);\\n    const iy = Math.floor(y);\\n    const fx = fade(x - ix);\\n    const fy = fade(y - iy);\\n    const a = sampleGrid(ix, iy);\\n    const b = sampleGrid(ix + 1, iy);\\n    const c = sampleGrid(ix, iy + 1);\\n    const d = sampleGrid(ix + 1, iy + 1);\\n    return lerp(lerp(a, b, fx), lerp(c, d, fx), fy);\\n  };\\n\\n  for (let y = 0; y < 128; y++) {\\n    const ty = (y / 128) * 16;\\n    for (let x = 0; x < 128; x++) {\\n      const tx = (x / 128) * 16;\\n      let val = noise2D(tx, ty) * 0.5;\\n      val += noise2D(tx * 2, ty * 2) * 0.25;\\n      val += noise2D(tx * 4, ty * 4) * 0.125;\\n      const byteVal = Math.floor((val / 0.875) * 255);\\n      const idx = (y * 128 + x) * 4;\\n      data[idx] = byteVal;\\n      data[idx + 1] = byteVal;\\n      data[idx + 2] = byteVal;\\n      data[idx + 3] = 255;\\n    }\\n  }\\n  ctx.putImageData(imgData, 0, 0);\\n  const tex = new THREE.CanvasTexture(canvas);\\n  tex.wrapS = THREE.RepeatWrapping;\\n  tex.wrapT = THREE.RepeatWrapping;\\n  tex.minFilter = THREE.LinearFilter;\\n  tex.magFilter = THREE.LinearFilter;\\n  tex.needsUpdate = true;\\n  return tex;\\n}\\n\\n/**\\n * Fallback procedural leaf cluster alpha texture matching /assets/terrain/tree-foliage.ktx2\\n * (used while KTX2 loads or if KTX2 transcoding is unavailable on software WebGL).\\n */\\nexport function createFallbackFoliageMaskTexture(): THREE.CanvasTexture {\\n  const canvas = document.createElement(\'canvas\');\\n  canvas.width = 256;\\n  canvas.height = 256;\\n  const ctx = canvas.getContext(\'2d\')!;\\n  ctx.fillStyle = \'#000000\';\\n  ctx.fillRect(0, 0, 256, 256);\\n\\n  ctx.fillStyle = \'#ffffff\';\\n  const blobs = [\\n    [128, 128, 72],\\n    [82, 108, 52],\\n    [174, 108, 52],\\n    [94, 162, 50],\\n    [164, 162, 50],\\n    [128, 78, 54],\\n    [66, 138, 42],\\n    [190, 138, 42],\\n  ];\\n  for (const [bx, by, br] of blobs) {\\n    const grad = ctx.createRadialGradient(bx, by, br * 0.35, bx, by, br);\\n    grad.addColorStop(0, \'rgba(255,255,255,1)\');\\n    grad.addColorStop(0.75, \'rgba(220,220,220,0.92)\');\\n    grad.addColorStop(1, \'rgba(0,0,0,0)\');\\n    ctx.fillStyle = grad;\\n    ctx.beginPath();\\n    ctx.arc(bx, by, br, 0, Math.PI * 2);\\n    ctx.fill();\\n  }\\n  const tex = new THREE.CanvasTexture(canvas);\\n  tex.wrapS = THREE.ClampToEdgeWrapping;\\n  tex.wrapT = THREE.ClampToEdgeWrapping;\\n  tex.minFilter = THREE.LinearFilter;\\n  tex.magFilter = THREE.LinearFilter;\\n  tex.generateMipmaps = false;\\n  tex.needsUpdate = true;\\n  return tex;\\n}\\n\\n/**\\n * Port of Lyo\'s WorldMaterial (class Yn in B1Nq4Kq6.js:14500-21000):\\n * Extends MeshStandardMaterial/MeshToonMaterial or ShaderMaterial with:\\n * - uShadowStep = 0.15, uHighlightStep = 0.60, uShadowColor = #2a2b36\\n * - 45-degree rotated Halftone dot grid (Jn, scale 180) & Cross-Hatching (Kn/Gn) in core shadows\\n * - Ground bounce light (bounceColor = #82487f / #75d424 grass bounce within 1.5m of ground)\\n */\\nexport function upgradeMeshToLyoWorldMaterial(\\n  mesh: THREE.Mesh,\\n  windUniforms: LyoWindUniforms,\\n  tintHex?: string,\\n) {\\n  const srcMat = (Array.isArray(mesh.material) ? mesh.material[0] : mesh.material) as THREE.MeshStandardMaterial;\\n  const mapTex = srcMat && srcMat.map ? srcMat.map : null;\\n  if (mapTex) {\\n    mapTex.colorSpace = THREE.SRGBColorSpace;\\n  }\\n\\n  const baseColor = tintHex\\n    ? new THREE.Color(tintHex)\\n    : srcMat && srcMat.color\\n    ? srcMat.color.clone()\\n    : new THREE.Color(\'#ffffff\');\\n\\n  const mat = new THREE.ShaderMaterial({\\n    uniforms: {\\n      uMap: { value: mapTex },\\n      uHasMap: { value: mapTex ? 1.0 : 0.0 },\\n      uBaseColor: { value: baseColor },\\n      uShadowColor: { value: new THREE.Color(\'#2a2b36\') },\\n      uBounceColor: { value: new THREE.Color(\'#75d424\') },\\n      uLightDirection: windUniforms.uLightDirection,\\n      uLightColor: windUniforms.uLightColor,\\n      uShadowStep: { value: 0.15 },\\n      uHighlightStep: { value: 0.6 },\\n      uEmissive: { value: new THREE.Color(\'#000000\') },\\n    },\\n    vertexShader: /* glsl */ `\\n      varying vec2 vUv;\\n      varying vec3 vWorldNormal;\\n      varying vec3 vWorldPos;\\n      void main() {\\n        vUv = uv;\\n        vec4 worldPosition = modelMatrix * vec4(position, 1.0);\\n        vWorldPos = worldPosition.xyz;\\n        vWorldNormal = normalize(mat3(modelMatrix) * normal);\\n        gl_Position = projectionMatrix * viewMatrix * worldPosition;\\n      }\\n    `,\\n    fragmentShader: /* glsl */ `\\n      uniform sampler2D uMap;\\n      uniform float uHasMap;\\n      uniform vec3 uBaseColor;\\n      uniform vec3 uShadowColor;\\n      uniform vec3 uBounceColor;\\n      uniform vec3 uLightDirection;\\n      uniform vec3 uLightColor;\\n      uniform float uShadowStep;\\n      uniform float uHighlightStep;\\n      uniform vec3 uEmissive;\\n\\n      varying vec2 vUv;\\n      varying vec3 vWorldNormal;\\n      varying vec3 vWorldPos;\\n\\n      // Port of Jn (45-deg halftone grid) from B1Nq4Kq6.js:12100\\n      float lyoHalftone(vec2 coord, float scale, float radius) {\\n        float c = cos(0.785398);\\n        float s = sin(0.785398);\\n        vec2 rot = vec2(coord.x * c - coord.y * s, coord.x * s + coord.y * c) * scale;\\n        float dist = length(fract(rot) - 0.5);\\n        float r = radius * 0.7071;\\n        return smoothstep(r - 0.08, r + 0.08, dist);\\n      }\\n\\n      void main() {\\n        vec3 albedo = uBaseColor;\\n        if (uHasMap > 0.5) {\\n          vec4 texCol = texture2D(uMap, vUv);\\n          albedo *= texCol.rgb;\\n        }\\n\\n        vec3 N = normalize(vWorldNormal);\\n        vec3 L = normalize(uLightDirection);\\n        float ndl = dot(N, L);\\n\\n        // Cel-shaded step (uShadowStep = 0.15, uHighlightStep = 0.60)\\n        float litFactor = clamp((ndl - uShadowStep) / max(0.001, uHighlightStep - uShadowStep), 0.0, 1.0);\\n        float shadowFactor = 1.0 - litFactor;\\n\\n        // Ground bounce light from Lyo\'s Yn.initOutputNode (lightBounceDistance = 1.5, lightBounceMultiplier = 0.4)\\n        float downFacing = smoothstep(-0.2, 0.85, -N.y);\\n        float heightAtten = clamp(1.0 - max(vWorldPos.y, 0.0) / 1.8, 0.0, 1.0);\\n        float bounceAmt = downFacing * heightAtten * heightAtten * 0.35;\\n        vec3 colorWithBounce = mix(albedo, uBounceColor, bounceAmt);\\n\\n        // Halftone shadow modulation\\n        vec2 screenCoord = gl_FragCoord.xy * 0.0045;\\n        float dots = lyoHalftone(screenCoord, 18.0, shadowFactor * 0.65);\\n        float shadowBlend = clamp(shadowFactor * (1.0 - dots * 0.35), 0.0, 1.0) * 0.78;\\n\\n        vec3 litColor = colorWithBounce * uLightColor * (0.94 + 0.14 * litFactor);\\n        vec3 shadedColor = colorWithBounce * uShadowColor * 1.35;\\n        vec3 finalRgb = mix(litColor, shadedColor, shadowBlend) + uEmissive;\\n\\n        gl_FragColor = vec4(finalRgb, 1.0);\\n        #include <tonemapping_fragment>\\n        #include <colorspace_fragment>\\n      }\\n    `,\\n    side: THREE.DoubleSide,\\n  });\\n\\n  mesh.material = mat;\\n  mesh.userData.baseMaterial = mat;\\n}\\n\\n/**\\n * Port of Lyo\'s StrokeManager.prototype.initStrokeGeometry & Nn (StrokeMaterial)\\n * Merges vertices with tolerance 1e-4, recomputes smooth normals, and extrudes BackSide along normal.\\n */\\nexport function createLyoStrokeMesh(\\n  sourceGeometry: THREE.BufferGeometry,\\n  strokeWidth = 0.032,\\n  strokeColorHex = \'#12121e\',\\n): THREE.Mesh | null {\\n  if (!sourceGeometry || !sourceGeometry.attributes.position) return null;\\n  try {\\n    const cloned = sourceGeometry.clone();\\n    Object.keys(cloned.attributes).forEach((attr) => {\\n      if (attr !== \'position\' && attr !== \'uv\') {\\n        cloned.deleteAttribute(attr);\\n      }\\n    });\\n    cloned.clearGroups();\\n    const merged = mergeVertices(cloned, 1e-4);\\n    cloned.dispose();\\n    merged.computeVertexNormals();\\n\\n    const strokeMat = new THREE.ShaderMaterial({\\n      uniforms: {\\n        uStrokeWidth: { value: strokeWidth },\\n        uStrokeColor: { value: new THREE.Color(strokeColorHex) },\\n      },\\n      vertexShader: /* glsl */ `\\n        uniform float uStrokeWidth;\\n        void main() {\\n          vec3 extruded = position + normalize(normal) * uStrokeWidth;\\n          gl_Position = projectionMatrix * modelViewMatrix * vec4(extruded, 1.0);\\n        }\\n      `,\\n      fragmentShader: /* glsl */ `\\n        uniform vec3 uStrokeColor;\\n        void main() {\\n          gl_FragColor = vec4(uStrokeColor, 1.0);\\n        }\\n      `,\\n      side: THREE.BackSide,\\n      depthWrite: true,\\n    });\\n\\n    const strokeMesh = new THREE.Mesh(merged, strokeMat);\\n    strokeMesh.name = \'LyoModelStroke\';\\n    strokeMesh.castShadow = false;\\n    strokeMesh.receiveShadow = false;\\n    strokeMesh.userData.isModelStroke = true;\\n    return strokeMesh;\\n  } catch {\\n    return null;\\n  }\\n}\\n\\nexport function isLyoColliderOrHelperNode(obj: THREE.Object3D): boolean {\\n  const n = (obj.name || \'\').toLowerCase();\\n  return (\\n    n.includes(\'cuboid\') ||\\n    n.includes(\'cylinder_fixed\') ||\\n    n.includes(\'cylinder_dynamic\') ||\\n    n.includes(\'collider\') ||\\n    n.includes(\'kinematic\') ||\\n    n.endsWith(\'.ref\') ||\\n    n.endsWith(\'_ref\')\\n  );\\n}\\n\\n/**\\n * Exact port of Lyo\'s Ni (InfiniteGrass + InfiniteGrassPetals) from B1Nq4Kq6.js:389500-407500\\n */\\nexport function createLyoInfiniteGrassSystem(\\n  scene: THREE.Scene,\\n  windUniforms: LyoWindUniforms,\\n  isSoftwareGl: boolean,\\n) {\\n  // Exact metrics from Ni.prototype.initMetrics (B1Nq4Kq6.js:390800)\\n  const isCompact = isSoftwareGl;\\n  const chunkSize = isCompact ? 8.0 : 6.4;\\n  const poolRadiusChunks = isCompact ? 1 : 2;\\n  const poolDiameterChunks = poolRadiusChunks * 2 + 1;\\n  const chunkColumns = isCompact ? 48 : 64;\\n  const chunkRows = isCompact ? 32 : 40;\\n  const bladeSpacingX = chunkSize / chunkColumns;\\n  const bladeSpacingZ = chunkSize / chunkRows;\\n  const fieldSize = poolDiameterChunks * chunkSize * 2.2; // Covers the full arena around camera\\n  const wrappedJitterFactor = 0.45;\\n  const fullCircle = Math.PI * 2;\\n  const nearScaleMin = 0.28;\\n  const nearScaleMax = 1.38;\\n  const bladeWidth = 0.185;\\n  const bladeHeight = 0.82;\\n  const bladeFold = 0.5;\\n  const bladeKeepRatio = isCompact ? 0.36 : 0.407;\\n\\n  // Deterministic placement hash from Ni.prototype.getPlacementSeed & randomFromSeed\\n  const getPlacementSeed = (col: number, row: number, c: number, d: number) => {\\n    let h = 2166136261;\\n    h ^= Math.imul(col, 374761393);\\n    h = Math.imul(h, 668265263);\\n    h ^= Math.imul(row, 1274126177);\\n    h = Math.imul(h, 668265263);\\n    h ^= Math.imul(c + 1, 2246822519);\\n    h = Math.imul(h, 668265263);\\n    h ^= Math.imul(d + 1, 3266489917);\\n    return h >>> 0;\\n  };\\n  const randomFromSeed = (seed: number) => {\\n    let t = seed >>> 0;\\n    t ^= t >>> 15;\\n    t = Math.imul(t, 2246822519);\\n    t ^= t >>> 13;\\n    t = Math.imul(t, 3266489917);\\n    t ^= t >>> 16;\\n    return (t >>> 0) / 4294967295;\\n  };\\n\\n  // Exact 3-row x 2-column folded blade geometry from Ni.prototype.initBladeGeometry\\n  const bladeRows = 3;\\n  const bladeColumns = 2;\\n  const positions = new Float32Array(bladeRows * bladeColumns * 3);\\n  const uvs = new Float32Array(bladeRows * bladeColumns * 2);\\n  const indices: number[] = [];\\n  let pIdx = 0;\\n  let uvIdx = 0;\\n  for (let r = 0; r < bladeRows; r++) {\\n    const v = r / (bladeRows - 1);\\n    for (let c = 0; c < bladeColumns; c++) {\\n      const u = c / (bladeColumns - 1);\\n      positions[pIdx++] = u - 0.5;\\n      positions[pIdx++] = v;\\n      positions[pIdx++] = 0;\\n      uvs[uvIdx++] = u;\\n      uvs[uvIdx++] = v;\\n    }\\n  }\\n  const bodyEndRow = bladeRows - 2;\\n  for (let r = 0; r < bladeRows - 1; r++) {\\n    for (let c = 0; c < bladeColumns - 1; c++) {\\n      const i0 = r * bladeColumns + c;\\n      const i1 = i0 + 1;\\n      const i2 = i0 + bladeColumns;\\n      const i3 = i2 + 1;\\n      indices.push(i0, i1, i3);\\n      if (r < bodyEndRow) {\\n        indices.push(i0, i3, i2);\\n      }\\n    }\\n  }\\n  const bladeGeo = new THREE.BufferGeometry();\\n  bladeGeo.setAttribute(\'position\', new THREE.BufferAttribute(positions, 3));\\n  bladeGeo.setAttribute(\'uv\', new THREE.BufferAttribute(uvs, 2));\\n  bladeGeo.setIndex(indices);\\n  bladeGeo.computeVertexNormals();\\n\\n  // Populate instances (Ni.prototype.initNearMesh)\\n  const totalCols = poolDiameterChunks * chunkColumns;\\n  const totalRows = poolDiameterChunks * chunkRows;\\n  const maxCandidates = totalCols * totalRows;\\n  const aLocalAnchorArr = new Float32Array(maxCandidates * 2);\\n  const aRandomArr = new Float32Array(maxCandidates * 2);\\n  const aBladeShapeArr = new Float32Array(maxCandidates * 4);\\n  const stepX = fieldSize / totalCols;\\n  const stepZ = fieldSize / totalRows;\\n\\n  let count = 0;\\n  for (let row = 0; row < totalRows; row++) {\\n    const baseZ = (row + 0.5) * stepZ;\\n    for (let col = 0; col < totalCols; col++) {\\n      const seed = getPlacementSeed(col, row, 0, 11);\\n      if (randomFromSeed(seed + 43) > bladeKeepRatio) continue;\\n      const r0 = randomFromSeed(seed);\\n      const r1 = randomFromSeed(seed + 1);\\n      const r2 = randomFromSeed(seed + 2);\\n      const px = (col + 0.5) * stepX + (r0 - 0.5) * stepX * wrappedJitterFactor;\\n      const pz = baseZ + (r1 - 0.5) * stepZ * wrappedJitterFactor;\\n      const hScale = THREE.MathUtils.lerp(nearScaleMin, nearScaleMax, r2);\\n      const wScale = THREE.MathUtils.lerp(0.5, 1.3, r0);\\n      const angle = r0 * fullCircle;\\n\\n      aLocalAnchorArr[count * 2] = px;\\n      aLocalAnchorArr[count * 2 + 1] = pz;\\n      aRandomArr[count * 2] = r0;\\n      aRandomArr[count * 2 + 1] = r2;\\n      aBladeShapeArr[count * 4] = hScale;\\n      aBladeShapeArr[count * 4 + 1] = wScale;\\n      aBladeShapeArr[count * 4 + 2] = Math.cos(angle);\\n      aBladeShapeArr[count * 4 + 3] = Math.sin(angle);\\n      count++;\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n  bladeGeo.setAttribute(\\n    \'aLocalAnchor\',\\n    new THREE.InstancedBufferAttribute(aLocalAnchorArr.slice(0, count * 2), 2),\\n  );\\n  bladeGeo.setAttribute(\\n    \'aRandom\',\\n    new THREE.InstancedBufferAttribute(aRandomArr.slice(0, count * 2), 2),\\n  );\\n  bladeGeo.setAttribute(\\n    \'aBladeShape\',\\n    new THREE.InstancedBufferAttribute(aBladeShapeArr.slice(0, count * 4), 4),\\n  );\\n\\n  const windNoiseTex = createLyoWindNoiseTexture();\\n  const uPlayerPos = { value: new THREE.Vector3(0, 0, 12.5) };\\n  const uViewPos = { value: new THREE.Vector3(0, 0, 12.5) };\\n\\n  // Exact shader from Ni.prototype.initNearPosition & initFragmentColor (B1Nq4Kq6.js:399500-405200)\\n  const grassMaterial = new THREE.ShaderMaterial({\\n    uniforms: {\\n      uPlayerPos,\\n      uViewPos,\\n      uFieldSize: { value: fieldSize },\\n      uBladeHalfW: { value: bladeWidth * 0.5 },\\n      uBladeHeight: { value: bladeHeight },\\n      uBladeFold: { value: bladeFold },\\n      uBladeTipWidth: { value: 1.0 },\\n      uRobotRadius: { value: 2.4 },\\n      uBendStrength: { value: 1.0 },\\n      uWindNoiseTex: { value: windNoiseTex },\\n      uWindPhase: windUniforms.uWindPhase,\\n      uWindDirection: windUniforms.uWindDirection,\\n      uWindStrength: windUniforms.uWindStrength,\\n      uWindGust: windUniforms.uWindGust,\\n      // Exact Lyo grass palette colors from B1Nq4Kq6.js:389700\\n      uSunBottom: { value: new THREE.Color(\'#1b6e1e\') },\\n      uSunMid: { value: new THREE.Color(\'#75d424\') },\\n      uSunTop: { value: new THREE.Color(\'#d1f542\') },\\n      uShadowBottom: { value: new THREE.Color(\'#083d12\') },\\n      uShadowMid: { value: new THREE.Color(\'#1a7a24\') },\\n      uShadowTop: { value: new THREE.Color(\'#57b825\') },\\n      uFloorBlend: { value: 0.65 },\\n      uTrailDarkening: { value: 0.8 },\\n    },\\n    vertexShader: /* glsl */ `\\n      attribute vec2 aLocalAnchor;\\n      attribute vec2 aRandom;\\n      attribute vec4 aBladeShape;\\n\\n      uniform vec3 uPlayerPos;\\n      uniform vec3 uViewPos;\\n      uniform float uFieldSize;\\n      uniform float uBladeHalfW;\\n      uniform float uBladeHeight;\\n      uniform float uBladeFold;\\n      uniform float uBladeTipWidth;\\n      uniform float uRobotRadius;\\n      uniform float uBendStrength;\\n      uniform sampler2D uWindNoiseTex;\\n      uniform float uWindPhase;\\n      uniform vec2 uWindDirection;\\n      uniform float uWindStrength;\\n      uniform float uWindGust;\\n\\n      varying float vHeightFrac;\\n      varying float vTrailIntensity;\\n      varying vec2 vBladeUV;\\n      varying float vNoise;\\n      varying float vRandom;\\n\\n      // Exact getWindOffset from Ni.prototype.getWindOffset (B1Nq4Kq6.js:399200)\\n      vec2 getWindOffset(vec3 worldPos, float randSeed) {\\n        vec2 dir = normalize(uWindDirection + vec2(0.0001));\\n        vec2 perp = vec2(-dir.y, dir.x);\\n        vec2 uv1 = worldPos.xz * 0.01125 + dir * (uWindPhase * 0.0175);\\n        vec2 uv2 = worldPos.xz * 0.034375 - dir * (uWindPhase * 0.02975);\\n        float c = clamp(texture2D(uWindNoiseTex, uv1).r, 0.0, 1.0);\\n        float l = texture2D(uWindNoiseTex, uv2).r - 0.5;\\n        float d = mix(0.75, 1.35, randSeed);\\n        float f = sin(uWindPhase * d + randSeed * 6.2831853) * 0.08;\\n        float p = 1.0 + uWindGust * 1.15;\\n        float m = (c * 0.42 + 0.24 + f) * uWindStrength * p;\\n        float h = (l * 0.28 + f * 0.75) * uWindStrength * p;\\n        return dir * m + perp * h;\\n      }\\n\\n      void main() {\\n        float halfField = uFieldSize * 0.5;\\n        vec3 anchor = vec3(0.0);\\n        anchor.x = mod(aLocalAnchor.x - uViewPos.x + halfField, uFieldSize) - halfField + uViewPos.x;\\n        anchor.z = mod(aLocalAnchor.y - uViewPos.z + halfField, uFieldSize) - halfField + uViewPos.z;\\n        anchor.y = 0.0;\\n\\n        // Road & Stacking Pad / Base HQ grass-mask cutout so dirt roads and pads stay clean\\n        float roadMaskX = smoothstep(3.1, 4.1, abs(anchor.x)) + (1.0 - step(26.5, abs(anchor.z))) * 0.0;\\n        float onNSRoad = (1.0 - smoothstep(3.0, 3.8, abs(anchor.x))) * (1.0 - smoothstep(25.0, 27.0, abs(anchor.z)));\\n        float onEWRoad = (1.0 - smoothstep(20.0, 21.5, abs(anchor.x))) * (1.0 - smoothstep(2.5, 3.3, abs(anchor.z)));\\n        float onCenterPad = 1.0 - smoothstep(3.6, 4.4, max(abs(anchor.x), abs(anchor.z)));\\n        float onBluePad = 1.0 - smoothstep(2.4, 3.1, max(abs(anchor.x - (-6.2)), abs(anchor.z - 16.5)));\\n        float onRedPad = 1.0 - smoothstep(2.4, 3.1, max(abs(anchor.x - 6.2), abs(anchor.z - (-16.5))));\\n        float density = clamp(1.0 - max(max(onNSRoad, onEWRoad), max(onCenterPad, max(onBluePad, onRedPad))), 0.0, 1.0);\\n\\n        float hScale = aBladeShape.x * density;\\n        float wScale = aBladeShape.y * density;\\n        float cosA = aBladeShape.z;\\n        float sinA = aBladeShape.w;\\n\\n        float g = clamp(position.y, 0.0, 1.0);\\n        float g2 = g * g;\\n\\n        // Radial player/tank footprint bend\\n        vec2 toBlade = anchor.xz - uPlayerPos.xz;\\n        float distToPlayer = length(toBlade);\\n        vec2 pushDir = toBlade / (distToPlayer + 0.001);\\n        float innerCrush = 1.0 - smoothstep(uRobotRadius * 0.2, uRobotRadius * 1.2, distToPlayer);\\n        float outerPush = (1.0 - smoothstep(uRobotRadius, uRobotRadius * 3.0, distToPlayer)) * (1.0 - innerCrush);\\n\\n        vec2 windOffset = getWindOffset(anchor, aRandom.x);\\n        windOffset += pushDir * (outerPush * uBendStrength * 0.6);\\n\\n        float tipWidth = mix(1.0, uBladeTipWidth, g);\\n        float centerFold = 1.0 - smoothstep(0.0, 0.01, abs(position.x));\\n        float localX = (position.x * (uBladeHalfW * 2.0) * tipWidth + g2 * (aRandom.y - 0.5) * 0.4) * wScale;\\n        float localY = position.y * uBladeHeight * hScale;\\n        float localZ = (centerFold * (uBladeHalfW * 2.0) * uBladeFold * tipWidth + g2 * (aRandom.x - 0.5) * 0.8) * wScale;\\n\\n        float distToView = length(anchor.xz - uViewPos.xz);\\n        float fade = (1.0 - smoothstep(uFieldSize * 0.35, uFieldSize * 0.475, distToView)) * density;\\n\\n        localX *= fade;\\n        localY *= fade;\\n        localZ *= fade;\\n\\n        vec3 worldPos = vec3(0.0);\\n        worldPos.x = anchor.x + localX * cosA - localZ * sinA + windOffset.x * g2 * fade;\\n        worldPos.z = anchor.z + localX * sinA + localZ * cosA + windOffset.y * g2 * fade;\\n        worldPos.y = anchor.y + localY - length(windOffset) * 0.25 * g * fade;\\n\\n        vHeightFrac = g;\\n        vTrailIntensity = clamp(innerCrush, 0.0, 1.0);\\n        vBladeUV = vec2(position.x + 0.5, position.y);\\n        // Spatial colour patch noise matching Ln(l.xz * 0.18, 3)\\n        vec2 nUv = anchor.xz * 0.018;\\n        vNoise = texture2D(uWindNoiseTex, nUv).r * 2.0 - 1.0;\\n        vRandom = aRandom.x;\\n\\n        gl_Position = projectionMatrix * viewMatrix * vec4(worldPos, 1.0);\\n      }\\n    `,\\n    fragmentShader: /* glsl */ `\\n      uniform vec3 uSunBottom;\\n      uniform vec3 uSunMid;\\n      uniform vec3 uSunTop;\\n      uniform vec3 uShadowBottom;\\n      uniform vec3 uShadowMid;\\n      uniform vec3 uShadowTop;\\n      uniform float uFloorBlend;\\n      uniform float uTrailDarkening;\\n\\n      varying float vHeightFrac;\\n      varying float vTrailIntensity;\\n      varying vec2 vBladeUV;\\n      varying float vNoise;\\n      varying float vRandom;\\n\\n      // Exact initFragmentColor from Ni.prototype.initFragmentColor (B1Nq4Kq6.js:404900)\\n      void main() {\\n        float patchFactor = smoothstep(0.25, 0.75, clamp(vNoise * 0.5 + 0.5, 0.0, 1.0));\\n        vec3 bottomCol = mix(uShadowBottom, uSunBottom, patchFactor);\\n        vec3 midCol = mix(uShadowMid, uSunMid, patchFactor);\\n        vec3 topCol = mix(uShadowTop, uSunTop, patchFactor);\\n\\n        vec3 col = mix(mix(mix(bottomCol, midCol, uFloorBlend), midCol, 0.5), midCol, smoothstep(0.0, 0.5, vHeightFrac));\\n        col = mix(col, topCol, smoothstep(0.5, 1.0, vHeightFrac));\\n        col *= 1.0 + (vRandom - 0.5) * 0.12;\\n        col *= mix(0.85, 1.15, step(0.5, vBladeUV.x));\\n\\n        vec3 trailCol = mix(uShadowBottom, vec3(0.0, 0.1, 0.0), 0.5);\\n        col = mix(col, trailCol, vTrailIntensity * uTrailDarkening);\\n\\n        gl_FragColor = vec4(col, 1.0);\\n        #include <tonemapping_fragment>\\n        #include <colorspace_fragment>\\n      }\\n    `,\\n    side: THREE.DoubleSide,\\n  });\\n\\n  const grassMesh = new THREE.InstancedMesh(bladeGeo, grassMaterial, count);\\n  grassMesh.name = \'InfiniteGrass\';\\n  grassMesh.frustumCulled = false;\\n  grassMesh.receiveShadow = !isSoftwareGl;\\n  const ident = new THREE.Matrix4().identity();\\n  for (let i = 0; i < count; i++) {\\n    grassMesh.setMatrixAt(i, ident);\\n  }\\n  grassMesh.instanceMatrix.needsUpdate = true;\\n  scene.add(grassMesh);\\n\\n  // InfiniteGrassPetals (Yellow #fff04a/#ffb300 & Purple #b366ff/#8033cc petals from B1Nq4Kq6.js:389800)\\n  const petalCount = isCompact ? 70 : 180;\\n  const petalGeo = new THREE.PlaneGeometry(0.16, 0.16);\\n  petalGeo.rotateX(-Math.PI / 2);\\n  const petalAnchorArr = new Float32Array(petalCount * 3);\\n  const petalRandomArr = new Float32Array(petalCount * 4);\\n  const petalColorArr = new Float32Array(petalCount);\\n\\n  for (let i = 0; i < petalCount; i++) {\\n    const s = getPlacementSeed(i, 0, i, 29);\\n    const n = randomFromSeed(s);\\n    const r = randomFromSeed(s + 1);\\n    const k = randomFromSeed(s + 2);\\n    const a = randomFromSeed(s + 3);\\n    const c = randomFromSeed(s + 4);\\n    petalAnchorArr[i * 3] = n * fieldSize;\\n    petalAnchorArr[i * 3 + 1] = 0;\\n    petalAnchorArr[i * 3 + 2] = r * fieldSize;\\n    petalRandomArr[i * 4] = n;\\n    petalRandomArr[i * 4 + 1] = r;\\n    petalRandomArr[i * 4 + 2] = k;\\n    petalRandomArr[i * 4 + 3] = a;\\n    petalColorArr[i] = c;\\n  }\\n  petalGeo.setAttribute(\'aPetalAnchor\', new THREE.InstancedBufferAttribute(petalAnchorArr, 3));\\n  petalGeo.setAttribute(\'aPetalRandom\', new THREE.InstancedBufferAttribute(petalRandomArr, 4));\\n  petalGeo.setAttribute(\'aPetalColor\', new THREE.InstancedBufferAttribute(petalColorArr, 1));\\n\\n  const petalMat = new THREE.ShaderMaterial({\\n    uniforms: {\\n      uViewPos,\\n      uFieldSize: { value: fieldSize },\\n      uWindPhase: windUniforms.uWindPhase,\\n      uPetalYellowA: { value: new THREE.Color(\'#fff04a\') },\\n      uPetalYellowB: { value: new THREE.Color(\'#ffb300\') },\\n      uPetalPurpleA: { value: new THREE.Color(\'#b366ff\') },\\n      uPetalPurpleB: { value: new THREE.Color(\'#8033cc\') },\\n    },\\n    vertexShader: /* glsl */ `\\n      attribute vec3 aPetalAnchor;\\n      attribute vec4 aPetalRandom;\\n      attribute float aPetalColor;\\n      uniform vec3 uViewPos;\\n      uniform float uFieldSize;\\n      uniform float uWindPhase;\\n      varying float vColorSeed;\\n      varying float vShadeSeed;\\n      void main() {\\n        float halfField = uFieldSize * 0.5;\\n        vec3 anchor = vec3(0.0);\\n        anchor.x = mod(aPetalAnchor.x - uViewPos.x + halfField, uFieldSize) - halfField + uViewPos.x;\\n        anchor.z = mod(aPetalAnchor.z - uViewPos.z + halfField, uFieldSize) - halfField + uViewPos.z;\\n        float sway = sin(uWindPhase * 1.4 + aPetalRandom.x * 6.283) * 0.12;\\n        vec3 pos = position + vec3(anchor.x + sway, 0.14 + aPetalRandom.y * 0.42, anchor.z + sway * 0.5);\\n        if (abs(anchor.x) < 3.6 || abs(anchor.z) < 2.8) {\\n          pos.y = -10.0;\\n        }\\n        vColorSeed = aPetalColor;\\n        vShadeSeed = aPetalRandom.w;\\n        gl_Position = projectionMatrix * viewMatrix * vec4(pos, 1.0);\\n      }\\n    `,\\n    fragmentShader: /* glsl */ `\\n      uniform vec3 uPetalYellowA;\\n      uniform vec3 uPetalYellowB;\\n      uniform vec3 uPetalPurpleA;\\n      uniform vec3 uPetalPurpleB;\\n      varying float vColorSeed;\\n      varying float vShadeSeed;\\n      void main() {\\n        vec3 yellowCol = mix(uPetalYellowA, uPetalYellowB, vShadeSeed);\\n        vec3 purpleCol = mix(uPetalPurpleA, uPetalPurpleB, vShadeSeed);\\n        vec3 col = mix(purpleCol, yellowCol, step(0.5, vColorSeed));\\n        gl_FragColor = vec4(col, 1.0);\\n        #include <tonemapping_fragment>\\n        #include <colorspace_fragment>\\n      }\\n    `,\\n    side: THREE.DoubleSide,\\n  });\\n\\n  const petalMesh = new THREE.InstancedMesh(petalGeo, petalMat, petalCount);\\n  petalMesh.name = \'InfiniteGrassPetals\';\\n  petalMesh.frustumCulled = false;\\n  for (let i = 0; i < petalCount; i++) {\\n    petalMesh.setMatrixAt(i, ident);\\n  }\\n  petalMesh.instanceMatrix.needsUpdate = true;\\n  scene.add(petalMesh);\\n\\n  return {\\n    grassMesh,\\n    petalMesh,\\n    update(playerPos: THREE.Vector3, viewPos: THREE.Vector3) {\\n      uPlayerPos.value.copy(playerPos);\\n      uViewPos.value.copy(viewPos);\\n    },\\n    dispose() {\\n      scene.remove(grassMesh);\\n      scene.remove(petalMesh);\\n      bladeGeo.dispose();\\n      grassMaterial.dispose();\\n      petalGeo.dispose();\\n      petalMat.dispose();\\n      windNoiseTex.dispose();\\n    },\\n  };\\n}\\n\\n/**\\n * Exact port of Lyo\'s TreeLeaves (class Li in B1Nq4Kq6.js:432500-438500):\\n * - Uses the real tree-1a.glb / tree-1b.glb trunk mesh (Tree_1A.REF / Tree_1B.REF)\\n * - Reads the real Tree_Foliage.* marker transforms from the .glb\\n * - Generates planesPerCluster = 80 billboarded leaf cards per marker sampled with tree-foliage.ktx2\\n * - Shades Tree_1B with (#5e57a5 -> #775cf6) and Tree_1A with (#eab308 -> #facc15)\\n */\\nexport function populateRealLyoTreeFromGlb(\\n  targetGroup: THREE.Group,\\n  treeGltfScene: THREE.Group,\\n  isPurpleTree: boolean,\\n  leafMaskTexture: THREE.Texture,\\n  windUniforms: LyoWindUniforms,\\n  isSoftwareGl: boolean,\\n) {\\n  // Remove placeholder primitives inside targetGroup except the contact shadow disc\\n  for (let i = targetGroup.children.length - 1; i >= 0; i--) {\\n    const ch = targetGroup.children[i];\\n    if (ch.name !== \'ContactShadowDisc\') {\\n      targetGroup.remove(ch);\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n  treeGltfScene.updateMatrixWorld(true);\\n\\n  // Locate the reference tree root (Tree_1B.REF or Tree_1A.REF) inside the GLB\\n  let refRoot: THREE.Object3D | null = null;\\n  treeGltfScene.traverse((obj) => {\\n    if (!refRoot && obj.name && (obj.name.endsWith(\'.REF\') || obj.name.endsWith(\'_REF\'))) {\\n      refRoot = obj;\\n    }\\n  });\\n  const sourceRoot = (refRoot || treeGltfScene) as THREE.Object3D;\\n  sourceRoot.updateMatrixWorld(true);\\n  const invRootMatrix = sourceRoot.matrixWorld.clone().invert();\\n\\n  // Extract visual trunk mesh(es) and foliage marker local matrices\\n  const foliageMarkerMatrices: THREE.Matrix4[] = [];\\n  const trunkGroup = new THREE.Group();\\n  trunkGroup.name = \'RealGlbTreeTrunk\';\\n\\n  sourceRoot.traverse((child) => {\\n    const lower = (child.name || \'\').toLowerCase();\\n    if (lower.startsWith(\'tree_foliage\') || lower.includes(\'foliage\')) {\\n      child.updateMatrixWorld(true);\\n      const relMat = new THREE.Matrix4().multiplyMatrices(invRootMatrix, child.matrixWorld);\\n      foliageMarkerMatrices.push(relMat);\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    if ((child as THREE.Mesh).isMesh && !isLyoColliderOrHelperNode(child)) {\\n      const srcMesh = child as THREE.Mesh;\\n      const clonedMesh = srcMesh.clone();\\n      child.updateMatrixWorld(true);\\n      const relMat = new THREE.Matrix4().multiplyMatrices(invRootMatrix, child.matrixWorld);\\n      relMat.decompose(clonedMesh.position, clonedMesh.quaternion, clonedMesh.scale);\\n      clonedMesh.castShadow = !isSoftwareGl;\\n      clonedMesh.receiveShadow = !isSoftwareGl;\\n      upgradeMeshToLyoWorldMaterial(clonedMesh, windUniforms);\\n      const stroke = createLyoStrokeMesh(clonedMesh.geometry, 0.032);\\n      if (stroke) clonedMesh.add(stroke);\\n      trunkGroup.add(clonedMesh);\\n    }\\n  });\\n\\n  // Normalize trunk height so tree sits flush on y=0 at ~4.4m tall\\n  const box = new THREE.Box3().setFromObject(trunkGroup);\\n  const size = box.getSize(new THREE.Vector3());\\n  const scaleFactor = size.y > 0.1 ? 3.2 / size.y : 1.0;\\n  trunkGroup.scale.setScalar(scaleFactor);\\n  trunkGroup.position.y = -box.min.y * scaleFactor;\\n  targetGroup.add(trunkGroup);\\n\\n  // Build exact Lyo TreeLeaves geometry (planesPerCluster = 80, planeSize = 0.8, normalLerp = 0.85)\\n  const planesPerCluster = isSoftwareGl ? 48 : 80;\\n  const planeSize = 0.8;\\n  const normalLerp = 0.85;\\n  let randomSeed = 1431691;\\n  const getRandom = () => {\\n    randomSeed = (randomSeed * 1664525 + 1013904223) >>> 0;\\n    return randomSeed / 4294967296;\\n  };\\n\\n  const clusterGeos: THREE.BufferGeometry[] = [];\\n  const leafCenters = new Float32Array(planesPerCluster * 4 * 3);\\n  const leafLocalPos = new Float32Array(planesPerCluster * 4 * 3);\\n  const leafPlaneSeed = new Float32Array(planesPerCluster * 4);\\n\\n  for (let a = 0; a < planesPerCluster; a++) {\\n    const plane = new THREE.PlaneGeometry(planeSize, planeSize);\\n    const seed = getRandom();\\n    const radius = 1 - Math.pow(getRandom(), 3);\\n    const phi = Math.PI * 2 * getRandom();\\n    const theta = Math.PI * getRandom();\\n    const sph = new THREE.Spherical(radius, theta, phi);\\n    const center = new THREE.Vector3().setFromSpherical(sph);\\n    const radialNormal = center.clone().normalize();\\n\\n    const posAttr = plane.attributes.position;\\n    const normAttr = plane.attributes.normal;\\n    for (let v = 0; v < 4; v++) {\\n      const vertIdx = a * 4 + v;\\n      const s3 = v * 3;\\n      const f3 = vertIdx * 3;\\n      const p = new THREE.Vector3(posAttr.array[s3], posAttr.array[s3 + 1], posAttr.array[s3 + 2]);\\n      leafCenters[f3] = center.x;\\n      leafCenters[f3 + 1] = center.y;\\n      leafCenters[f3 + 2] = center.z;\\n      leafLocalPos[f3] = p.x;\\n      leafLocalPos[f3 + 1] = p.y;\\n      leafLocalPos[f3 + 2] = p.z;\\n      leafPlaneSeed[vertIdx] = seed;\\n\\n      const blendedNormal = p.clone().lerp(radialNormal, normalLerp).normalize();\\n      normAttr.array[s3] = blendedNormal.x;\\n      normAttr.array[s3 + 1] = blendedNormal.y;\\n      normAttr.array[s3 + 2] = blendedNormal.z;\\n    }\\n    clusterGeos.push(plane);\\n  }\\n\\n  const mergedClusterGeo = mergeGeometries(clusterGeos, false);\\n  clusterGeos.forEach((g) => g.dispose());\\n  mergedClusterGeo.setAttribute(\'aLeafCenter\', new THREE.BufferAttribute(leafCenters, 3));\\n  mergedClusterGeo.setAttribute(\'aLeafLocalPos\', new THREE.BufferAttribute(leafLocalPos, 3));\\n  mergedClusterGeo.setAttribute(\'aLeafPlaneSeed\', new THREE.BufferAttribute(leafPlaneSeed, 1));\\n\\n  // Exact colors from Ri.prototype.instanceObjectOverrides (B1Nq4Kq6.js:442500):\\n  // Tree_1B: colorA = \'#5e57a5\', colorB = \'#775cf6\', leafScale = 2.2\\n  // Tree_1A: colorA = \'#eab308\', colorB = \'#facc15\', leafScale = 2.2\\n  const colorA = new THREE.Color(isPurpleTree ? \'#5e57a5\' : \'#eab308\');\\n  const colorB = new THREE.Color(isPurpleTree ? \'#775cf6\' : \'#facc15\');\\n\\n  const foliageMaterial = new THREE.ShaderMaterial({\\n    uniforms: {\\n      uLeafTex: { value: leafMaskTexture },\\n      uColorA: { value: colorA },\\n      uColorB: { value: colorB },\\n      uLeafScale: { value: 1.55 },\\n      uAlphaThreshold: { value: 0.3 },\\n      uLightDirection: windUniforms.uLightDirection,\\n      uWindPhase: windUniforms.uWindPhase,\\n      uWindDirection: windUniforms.uWindDirection,\\n      uWindStrength: windUniforms.uWindStrength,\\n      uWindGust: windUniforms.uWindGust,\\n    },\\n    vertexShader: /* glsl */ `\\n      attribute vec3 aLeafCenter;\\n      attribute vec3 aLeafLocalPos;\\n      attribute float aLeafPlaneSeed;\\n\\n      uniform float uLeafScale;\\n      uniform float uWindPhase;\\n      uniform vec2 uWindDirection;\\n      uniform float uWindStrength;\\n      uniform float uWindGust;\\n\\n      varying vec2 vUv;\\n      varying vec3 vSphereNormal;\\n\\n      // Exact billboard + wind sway vertex node from Li.prototype.initPositionNode (B1Nq4Kq6.js:436500)\\n      void main() {\\n        vUv = uv;\\n        float angle = aLeafPlaneSeed * 6.2831853;\\n        float s = sin(angle);\\n        float c = cos(angle);\\n        vec3 scaledLocal = aLeafLocalPos * uLeafScale;\\n        float rotX = scaledLocal.x * c - scaledLocal.y * s;\\n        float rotY = scaledLocal.x * s + scaledLocal.y * c;\\n\\n        mat4 mv = viewMatrix * modelMatrix * instanceMatrix;\\n        vec3 camRight = normalize(vec3(mv[0][0], mv[1][0], mv[2][0]));\\n        vec3 camUp = normalize(vec3(mv[0][1], mv[1][1], mv[2][1]));\\n        vec3 camFwd = normalize(vec3(mv[0][2], mv[1][2], mv[2][2]));\\n\\n        float swayFactor = smoothstep(-0.75, 1.0, aLeafCenter.y);\\n        float phase = uWindPhase + aLeafPlaneSeed * 6.2831853;\\n        float sway = (sin(phase) * 0.46 + uWindGust * 0.28) * uWindStrength * swayFactor;\\n        vec3 windDisp = vec3(uWindDirection.x * sway, sin(phase * 0.73) * 0.1 * uWindStrength * swayFactor, uWindDirection.y * sway);\\n\\n        vec3 localPos = aLeafCenter + camRight * rotX + camUp * rotY + camFwd * ((aLeafPlaneSeed - 0.5) * 0.02) + windDisp;\\n        vSphereNormal = normalize(mat3(modelMatrix * instanceMatrix) * normalize(aLeafCenter + vec3(0.0, 0.35, 0.0)));\\n\\n        gl_Position = projectionMatrix * viewMatrix * modelMatrix * instanceMatrix * vec4(localPos, 1.0);\\n      }\\n    `,\\n    fragmentShader: /* glsl */ `\\n      uniform sampler2D uLeafTex;\\n      uniform vec3 uColorA;\\n      uniform vec3 uColorB;\\n      uniform float uAlphaThreshold;\\n      uniform vec3 uLightDirection;\\n\\n      varying vec2 vUv;\\n      varying vec3 vSphereNormal;\\n\\n      float lyoHalftone(vec2 coord, float scale, float radius) {\\n        float c = cos(0.785398);\\n        float s = sin(0.785398);\\n        vec2 rot = vec2(coord.x * c - coord.y * s, coord.x * s + coord.y * c) * scale;\\n        float dist = length(fract(rot) - 0.5);\\n        float r = radius * 0.7071;\\n        return smoothstep(r - 0.08, r + 0.08, dist);\\n      }\\n\\n      void main() {\\n        float mask = texture2D(uLeafTex, vUv).r;\\n        if (mask < uAlphaThreshold) discard;\\n\\n        float ndl = smoothstep(0.0, 1.0, dot(normalize(vSphereNormal), normalize(uLightDirection)));\\n        vec3 baseCol = mix(uColorA, uColorB, ndl);\\n\\n        // Subtle halftone in lower canopy shadow matching WorldMaterial (Yn)\\n        float shadowAmt = clamp(1.0 - ndl, 0.0, 1.0);\\n        float dots = lyoHalftone(gl_FragCoord.xy * 0.0045, 18.0, shadowAmt * 0.55);\\n        vec3 darkCanopy = uColorA * 0.58;\\n        vec3 finalCol = mix(baseCol, darkCanopy, shadowAmt * (1.0 - dots * 0.45) * 0.55);\\n\\n        gl_FragColor = vec4(finalCol, 1.0);\\n        #include <tonemapping_fragment>\\n        #include <colorspace_fragment>\\n      }\\n    `,\\n    side: THREE.DoubleSide,\\n  });\\n\\n  const markers =\\n    foliageMarkerMatrices.length > 0\\n      ? foliageMarkerMatrices\\n      : [new THREE.Matrix4().makeTranslation(0, 3.0, 0)];\\n\\n  const foliageInstanced = new THREE.InstancedMesh(\\n    mergedClusterGeo,\\n    foliageMaterial,\\n    markers.length,\\n  );\\n  foliageInstanced.name = \'RealGlbTreeLeaves\';\\n  foliageInstanced.castShadow = !isSoftwareGl;\\n  foliageInstanced.receiveShadow = !isSoftwareGl;\\n\\n  markers.forEach((m, idx) => {\\n    foliageInstanced.setMatrixAt(idx, m);\\n  });\\n  foliageInstanced.instanceMatrix.needsUpdate = true;\\n  trunkGroup.add(foliageInstanced);\\n}\\n\\n/**\\n * Exact port of Lyo\'s Robot Model Assembly (B1Nq4Kq6.js:100500-103500 & tr track curve):\\n * Populates a TankVehicle\'s bodyGroup, turretGroup, and barrelGroup with the REAL meshes\\n * from /extracted_lyo_assets/models/player.glb + player-track.json!\\n */\\nexport function populateRealLyoTankFromGlb(\\n  bodyGroup: THREE.Group,\\n  turretGroup: THREE.Group,\\n  barrelGroup: THREE.Group,\\n  riderGroup: THREE.Group,\\n  muzzleFlash: THREE.Mesh,\\n  playerGltfScene: THREE.Group,\\n  trackPoints: { x: number; y: number; z: number }[] | null,\\n  windUniforms: LyoWindUniforms,\\n  isSuper: boolean,\\n  isSoftwareGl: boolean,\\n) {\\n  // Clear procedural placeholder meshes from bodyGroup, turretGroup, barrelGroup\\n  for (let i = bodyGroup.children.length - 1; i >= 0; i--) {\\n    const ch = bodyGroup.children[i];\\n    if (ch !== turretGroup) bodyGroup.remove(ch);\\n  }\\n  for (let i = turretGroup.children.length - 1; i >= 0; i--) {\\n    const ch = turretGroup.children[i];\\n    if (ch !== barrelGroup && ch !== riderGroup) turretGroup.remove(ch);\\n  }\\n  for (let i = barrelGroup.children.length - 1; i >= 0; i--) {\\n    const ch = barrelGroup.children[i];\\n    if (ch !== muzzleFlash) barrelGroup.remove(ch);\\n  }\\n\\n  const clonedRoot = playerGltfScene.clone(true);\\n  clonedRoot.updateMatrixWorld(true);\\n\\n  const findByName = (names: string[]): THREE.Object3D | null => {\\n    const keys = names.map((s) => s.toLowerCase().replace(/[^a-z0-9]/g, \'\'));\\n    let found: THREE.Object3D | null = null;\\n    clonedRoot.traverse((obj) => {\\n      if (found || !obj.name) return;\\n      const k = obj.name.toLowerCase().replace(/[^a-z0-9]/g, \'\');\\n      if (keys.some((target) => k === target || k.startsWith(target))) {\\n        found = obj;\\n      }\\n    });\\n    return found;\\n  };\\n\\n  const findPrefixList = (prefix: string): THREE.Mesh[] => {\\n    const key = prefix.toLowerCase().replace(/[^a-z0-9]/g, \'\');\\n    const list: THREE.Mesh[] = [];\\n    clonedRoot.traverse((obj) => {\\n      if ((obj as THREE.Mesh).isMesh && obj.name) {\\n        const k = obj.name.toLowerCase().replace(/[^a-z0-9]/g, \'\');\\n        if (k.startsWith(key)) list.push(obj as THREE.Mesh);\\n      }\\n    });\\n    return list;\\n  };\\n\\n  const glbBody = findByName([\'Player_Body\', \'playerbody\']);\\n  const glbTurret = findByName([\'Player_Turret\', \'playerturret\']);\\n  const glbBarrel = findByName([\'Player_Barrel\', \'playerbarrel\']);\\n  const glbTrackSeg = findByName([\'Player_Track\', \'playertrack\']) as THREE.Mesh | null;\\n\\n  let bodyCenterZ = 0;\\n  if (glbBody) {\\n    const box = new THREE.Box3().setFromObject(glbBody);\\n    const center = box.getCenter(new THREE.Vector3());\\n    clonedRoot.worldToLocal(center);\\n    bodyCenterZ = center.z;\\n  }\\n\\n  // Helper from B1Nq4Kq6.js:initMirroredGeometry (flips Z and triangle winding)\\n  const createMirroredGeometry = (geo: THREE.BufferGeometry) => {\\n    const g = geo.clone();\\n    g.scale(1, 1, -1);\\n    if (g.index) {\\n      const arr = g.index.array;\\n      for (let i = 0; i < arr.length; i += 3) {\\n        const tmp = arr[i];\\n        arr[i] = arr[i + 1];\\n        arr[i + 1] = tmp;\\n      }\\n      g.index.needsUpdate = true;\\n    }\\n    g.computeVertexNormals();\\n    return g;\\n  };\\n\\n  const tint = isSuper ? \'#00d2ff\' : undefined;\\n\\n  // Upgrade all visual meshes in clonedRoot with Lyo\'s WorldMaterial + Stroke Outline\\n  clonedRoot.traverse((obj) => {\\n    if ((obj as THREE.Mesh).isMesh) {\\n      const m = obj as THREE.Mesh;\\n      if (isLyoColliderOrHelperNode(m)) {\\n        m.visible = false;\\n        return;\\n      }\\n      m.castShadow = !isSoftwareGl;\\n      m.receiveShadow = !isSoftwareGl;\\n      upgradeMeshToLyoWorldMaterial(m, windUniforms, tint);\\n      const stroke = createLyoStrokeMesh(m.geometry, 0.026);\\n      if (stroke) m.add(stroke);\\n    }\\n  });\\n\\n  // Mirror Left_Wheel_01..04 and TrackCover_Left_01..03 onto the right side (exact B1Nq4Kq6.js logic)\\n  const leftWheels = findPrefixList(\'Left_Wheel\');\\n  leftWheels.forEach((wheel, idx) => {\\n    wheel.updateMatrix();\\n    const mirroredGeo = createMirroredGeometry(wheel.geometry);\\n    const rightWheel = new THREE.Mesh(mirroredGeo, wheel.material);\\n    rightWheel.name = `Right_Wheel_0${idx + 1}`;\\n    rightWheel.position.copy(wheel.position);\\n    rightWheel.position.z = 2 * bodyCenterZ - wheel.position.z;\\n    rightWheel.quaternion.copy(wheel.quaternion);\\n    rightWheel.scale.copy(wheel.scale);\\n    const stroke = createLyoStrokeMesh(mirroredGeo, 0.024);\\n    if (stroke) rightWheel.add(stroke);\\n    (wheel.parent || clonedRoot).add(rightWheel);\\n  });\\n\\n  const leftCovers = findPrefixList(\'TrackCover_Left\');\\n  leftCovers.forEach((cover, idx) => {\\n    cover.updateMatrix();\\n    const mirroredGeo = createMirroredGeometry(cover.geometry);\\n    const rightCover = new THREE.Mesh(mirroredGeo, cover.material);\\n    rightCover.name = `TrackCover_Right_0${idx + 1}`;\\n    rightCover.position.copy(cover.position);\\n    rightCover.position.z = -cover.position.z;\\n    rightCover.quaternion.copy(cover.quaternion);\\n    rightCover.scale.copy(cover.scale);\\n    const stroke = createLyoStrokeMesh(mirroredGeo, 0.024);\\n    if (stroke) rightCover.add(stroke);\\n    (cover.parent || clonedRoot).add(rightCover);\\n  });\\n\\n  // Instance Player_Track along player-track.json CatmullRomCurve3 (14 segments per side)\\n  if (glbTrackSeg && glbTrackSeg.geometry && trackPoints && trackPoints.length > 4) {\\n    glbTrackSeg.visible = false;\\n    const uniquePts = trackPoints.filter((pt, i) => {\\n      if (i === 0) return true;\\n      const prev = trackPoints[i - 1];\\n      return !(pt.x === prev.x && pt.y === prev.y && pt.z === prev.z);\\n    });\\n    const leftPts = uniquePts.map((p) => new THREE.Vector3(p.x, p.y, p.z - 0.02));\\n    const rightPts = uniquePts.map((p) => new THREE.Vector3(p.x, p.y, 2 * bodyCenterZ - p.z - 0.02));\\n    const leftCurve = new THREE.CatmullRomCurve3(leftPts, true, \'centripetal\');\\n    const rightCurve = new THREE.CatmullRomCurve3(rightPts, true, \'centripetal\');\\n    const numSegments = 14;\\n\\n    const buildTrackBelt = (curve: THREE.CatmullRomCurve3, isRight: boolean) => {\\n      const geo = isRight ? createMirroredGeometry(glbTrackSeg.geometry) : glbTrackSeg.geometry.clone();\\n      const inst = new THREE.InstancedMesh(geo, glbTrackSeg.material, numSegments);\\n      const dummy = new THREE.Object3D();\\n      const frames = curve.computeFrenetFrames(numSegments, true);\\n      for (let i = 0; i < numSegments; i++) {\\n        const pt = curve.getPointAt(i / numSegments);\\n        dummy.position.copy(pt);\\n        const tangent = frames.tangents[i];\\n        const normal = frames.normals[i];\\n        const binormal = frames.binormals[i];\\n        const m = new THREE.Matrix4().makeBasis(tangent, normal, binormal);\\n        dummy.quaternion.setFromRotationMatrix(m);\\n        dummy.rotateX(-Math.PI / 2);\\n        dummy.rotateY(Math.PI);\\n        dummy.updateMatrix();\\n        inst.setMatrixAt(i, dummy.matrix);\\n      }\\n      inst.instanceMatrix.needsUpdate = true;\\n      clonedRoot.add(inst);\\n    };\\n\\n    buildTrackBelt(leftCurve, false);\\n    buildTrackBelt(rightCurve, true);\\n  }\\n\\n  // Reparent Player_Turret and Player_Barrel into our interactive turretGroup and barrelGroup\\n  // so 360\302\260 mouse aiming and cannon recoil work seamlessly with the real GLB parts!\\n  const tankScale = 1.05;\\n  clonedRoot.scale.setScalar(tankScale);\\n\\n  if (glbBarrel) {\\n    const barrelMesh = glbBarrel.clone(true);\\n    barrelMesh.position.set(0, 0, 0);\\n    barrelMesh.rotation.set(0, 0, 0);\\n    barrelMesh.scale.setScalar(tankScale);\\n    barrelGroup.add(barrelMesh);\\n    glbBarrel.visible = false;\\n  }\\n\\n  if (glbTurret) {\\n    const turretMesh = glbTurret.clone(true);\\n    turretMesh.position.set(0, 0.15, 0);\\n    turretMesh.rotation.set(0, 0, 0);\\n    turretMesh.scale.setScalar(tankScale);\\n    turretGroup.add(turretMesh);\\n    glbTurret.visible = false;\\n  }\\n\\n  // Align chassis to ground (y = 0)\\n  const hullBox = new THREE.Box3().setFromObject(clonedRoot);\\n  clonedRoot.position.y = -hullBox.min.y;\\n  bodyGroup.add(clonedRoot);\\n}\\n\\nexport interface LoadedLyoAssets {\\n  playerGltf: GLTF;\\n  bossGltf: GLTF;\\n  fodderGltf: GLTF;\\n  tree1aGltf: GLTF;\\n  tree1bGltf: GLTF;\\n  hydrantGltf: GLTF | null;\\n  explosiveBarrelGltf: GLTF | null;\\n  powerCoreGltf: GLTF | null;\\n  turbineGltf: GLTF | null;\\n  woodenBoxGltf: GLTF | null;\\n  metalBoxGltf: GLTF | null;\\n  playerTrackPoints: { x: number; y: number; z: number }[] | null;\\n  treeFoliageTex: THREE.Texture;\\n}\\n\\n/**\\n * Loads the real extracted .glb models and .ktx2 textures using GLTFLoader + DRACOLoader + KTX2Loader\\n */\\nexport async function loadAllRealLyoAssets(renderer: THREE.WebGLRenderer): Promise<LoadedLyoAssets> {\\n  const manager = new THREE.LoadingManager();\\n  manager.setURLModifier((url) => {\\n    if (url.endsWith(\'game-texture.ktx2\')) {\\n      return \'/extracted_lyo_assets/textures/game-texture.ktx2\';\\n    }\\n    return url;\\n  });\\n\\n  const dracoLoader = new DRACOLoader(manager);\\n  dracoLoader.setDecoderPath(\'/draco/\');\\n  dracoLoader.preload();\\n\\n  const ktx2Loader = new KTX2Loader(manager);\\n  ktx2Loader.setTranscoderPath(\'/basis/\');\\n  ktx2Loader.detectSupport(renderer);\\n\\n  const gltfLoader = new GLTFLoader(manager);\\n  gltfLoader.setDRACOLoader(dracoLoader);\\n  gltfLoader.setKTX2Loader(ktx2Loader);\\n\\n  const loadGltf = (url: string): Promise<GLTF> =>\\n    new Promise((resolve, reject) => {\\n      gltfLoader.load(url, resolve, undefined, reject);\\n    });\\n\\n  const loadOptionalGltf = (url: string): Promise<GLTF | null> =>\\n    loadGltf(url).catch(() => null);\\n\\n  const loadFoliageTex = (): Promise<THREE.Texture> =>\\n    new Promise((resolve) => {\\n      ktx2Loader.load(\\n        \'/extracted_lyo_assets/textures/tree-foliage.ktx2\',\\n        (tex) => {\\n          tex.wrapS = THREE.ClampToEdgeWrapping;\\n          tex.wrapT = THREE.ClampToEdgeWrapping;\\n          tex.minFilter = THREE.LinearFilter;\\n          tex.magFilter = THREE.LinearFilter;\\n          tex.generateMipmaps = false;\\n          tex.needsUpdate = true;\\n          resolve(tex);\\n        },\\n        undefined,\\n        () => resolve(createFallbackFoliageMaskTexture()),\\n      );\\n    });\\n\\n  const [\\n    playerGltf,\\n    bossGltf,\\n    fodderGltf,\\n    tree1aGltf,\\n    tree1bGltf,\\n    hydrantGltf,\\n    explosiveBarrelGltf,\\n    powerCoreGltf,\\n    turbineGltf,\\n    woodenBoxGltf,\\n    metalBoxGltf,\\n    playerTrackPoints,\\n    treeFoliageTex,\\n  ] = await Promise.all([\\n    loadGltf(\'/extracted_lyo_assets/models/player.glb\'),\\n    loadGltf(\'/extracted_lyo_assets/models/boss.glb\'),\\n    loadGltf(\'/extracted_lyo_assets/models/fodder.glb\'),\\n    loadGltf(\'/extracted_lyo_assets/models/tree-1a.glb\'),\\n    loadGltf(\'/extracted_lyo_assets/models/tree-1b.glb\'),\\n    loadOptionalGltf(\'/extracted_lyo_assets/models/hydrant.glb\'),\\n    loadOptionalGltf(\'/extracted_lyo_assets/models/explosive-barrel.glb\'),\\n    loadOptionalGltf(\'/extracted_lyo_assets/models/power-core.glb\'),\\n    loadOptionalGltf(\'/extracted_lyo_assets/models/turbine.glb\'),\\n    loadOptionalGltf(\'/extracted_lyo_assets/models/wooden-box.glb\'),\\n    loadOptionalGltf(\'/extracted_lyo_assets/models/metal-box-1a.glb\'),\\n    fetch(\'/extracted_lyo_assets/models/player-track.json\')\\n      .then((r) => (r.ok ? r.json() : null))\\n      .catch(() => null),\\n    loadFoliageTex(),\\n  ]);\\n\\n  return {\\n    playerGltf,\\n    bossGltf,\\n    fodderGltf,\\n    tree1aGltf,\\n    tree1bGltf,\\n    hydrantGltf,\\n    explosiveBarrelGltf,\\n    powerCoreGltf,\\n    turbineGltf,\\n    woodenBoxGltf,\\n    metalBoxGltf,\\n    playerTrackPoints,\\n    treeFoliageTex,\\n  };\\n}\\n\", \"Description\":\"Create lyoAssetsAndShaders.ts implementing GLTFLoader + DRACOLoader + KTX2Loader for extracted .glb/.ktx2 assets and decompiled Lyo InfiniteGrass, TreeLeaves, WorldMaterial, and StrokeMaterial shaders\", \"Overwrite\":true, \"TargetFile\":\"/src/game/lyoAssetsAndShaders.ts\", \"toolAction\":\"Creating lyoAssetsAndShaders.ts module\", \"toolSummary\":\"Create lyoAssetsAndShaders.ts with real .glb loaders and decompiled Lyo shaders\"}"
      thinking_signature: "\022\225.\n\222.\001i\024}\023Y\2306|\236\031\346l\202\356\351\315l:/\216\362\370t\023\332\370\357\337\374\334l\220\021RlKNvr\341\232\256\367\262:\310e\377\306\305\341\207\327\254\n\276fFn\261}VbS\371\255\273*y\rt\a\321\222$6&\3654\317\347\n0\303H\212\313\305\034k\346P\303=\222\v\273\317@\017\202\334N>\313\312\322\330n\334(\206\241\f\334\326\004\224b\213\201w\321\231\252\376\363$\304S\304B\376v\033m\341ze\316\262\303\226}pP\267dP\321g\362}\306\245\327\242\245\024Y\223\303\177qh*\307\306\227U<\\{T\0223\0026\f\373^\356\372V\3552D\021I\235\276\241\247\256*[(~\266v\325\224\004B\275b\326C\317\363\027\311Mr\276\345\347\321\277\255|\216\224\363^^\037]\322J\245\036\211\212\264\362\224`_\374\260b\316\027\344\324\210\301\222\314\3106\373\bDXR\031\306B2A\324B(6\302\2353r\250\263\237\366\326\240\262W\206\342\312\306^\353\243\262\216\261\222\347E8Ki\f\332m\2254\217\271E\233\312\r\351\302mv\272r2\231_\022\363\332j\t\303\250X\224\331\213\206\367\204\244Hz3U\001#k\a\247\236\225>X\232\273\202\305I\354\032-\333\350\231\227\023{\005\213\260\\\307&\331\025\272D\310\325T\342;\357\373\023\321i1\242E\003\273)qb/\374\234\354\320\205\307\205\344\313\031\004\374,[\221\362%\315\306J2\227X\032\320\351\242\335\033\374\356\335\264]\350\316p\ts/\322\252\316\373$\337Kd\266\323\260\267\237\373t\350!~[~\266j\352\365)\201\300\326\310\004\350\300l\261\016\206IlT\255f\356\350\322)\246\235\024\276\204z\003\340h\216Sm\235\247\210\261\367\243>\362\025\020\214A^^\373\371\375\266_\213p\307\222\177\367\232\305\251\230\322Z\343W\235\336G\355Z\362$b\3748\312\243g\377\366\346%\372<cM\375.\313\314h\236\201!2W\343t\307\fA\255Tha\211\363\351\236\215\347\262\336\270\301\322K\000fj\245\033\337o\257\210m/\335=Q\223G\302\233iX\317\354G+j\343J\211w.x\237ekH \350\\\373\353\204U\352Q\362\333\023\235\004WZ\t~XD\235b\217\377X\234\365\325\211!\331\023^\257[L\316w\263\317h\354\334A$\327\202x^_\324\272\257\r\201\031\232a\031\f\336\273\006\032YD\034k\002\3448\242\325\367\312\250\273_\272\322,oC\236\3