  checkpoint {
    checkpoint_index: 3
    session_summary: "<summary>\n1. **Task Overview**\n   - **Core Request**: Re-run a deep Reverse Engineering Agent (REA) extraction on `https://longhoang-lyo.com/` by actually clicking the **\"LET\'S GO\"** button in a headless browser, capturing and downloading all real 3D `.glb` models and `.ktx2`/`.bin`/`.webp` textures, decompiling the production Three.js/TSL shaders from the JS bundles, and applying the real `.glb` files and shaders into our project:\n     - **LANGKAH 1 (Browser Interaction & Network Asset Capture)**:\n       1. Open `https://longhoang-lyo.com/` with a `page.on(\'response\')` listener attached BEFORE page load.\n       2. Wait for the **\"LET\'S GO\"** button in the DOM, click **\"LET\'S GO\"**, and wait >=10 seconds for the 3D scene to load.\n       3. Download all captured 3D models and textures (`.glb`, `.gltf`, `.bin`, `.ktx2`, `.webp`, `.png`, `.hdr`, `.json`) into `/extracted_lyo_assets/models/` and `/extracted_lyo_assets/textures/`.\n     - **LANGKAH 2 (Decompile & Extract TSL / Three.js Shaders from JS Bundle)**:\n       1. Extract from the main JS bundle (`B1Nq4Kq6.js`, `CQl67Veh.js`, `pr2JiyVy.js`, `BN-EMi2W.js`):\n          - **Grass / Wind Shader (`class Ni` / `InfiniteGrass` & `InfiniteGrassPetals`)**: `InstancedMesh` setup, instance count, blade geometry attributes (`aLocalAnchor`, `aRandom`, `aBladeShape`), uniform colors (`#1b6e1e`, `#75d424`, `#d1f542`, `#083d12`, `#1a7a24`, `#57b825`), and dual-scrolling Perlin wind formula (`getWindOffset`).\n          - **Foliage / Tree Shader (`class Li` / `TreeLeaves`)**: How purple/golden tree canopies (`tree-1b.glb` `#5e57a5`/`#775cf6` & `tree-1a.glb` `#eab308`/`#facc15`) are rendered using `planesPerCluster = 80` billboarded leaf cards sampled with `tree-foliage.ktx2` + halftone/cel-shading.\n          - **Tank Controller & Post-Processing (`CQl67Veh.js`, `class Oi`, `class Di`, `class Yn`, `class Nn`)**: Camera `fov = 35`, offset `Vector3(4, 14, 8)`, critical-damped spring follow, exact day/night fog & lighting colors, halftone/cross-hatching `WorldMaterial`, and back-face extruded `StrokeMaterial`.\n       2. Save the decompiled technical report to `/LYO_TECHNICAL_EXTRACTION.md`.\n     - **LANGKAH 3 (Apply Real `.glb` Models & Shaders to Our Project)**:\n       - Replace primitive `SphereGeometry`/`CylinderGeometry`/`BoxGeometry` trees and tanks with the real downloaded `.glb` models (`tree-1a.glb`, `tree-1b.glb`, `player.glb`, `power-core.glb`, `turbine.glb`, `hydrant.glb`, `explosive-barrel.glb`) loaded via `GLTFLoader` + `DRACOLoader` + `KTX2Loader`.\n       - Apply the decompiled Lyo Grass (`InfiniteGrass` + `InfiniteGrassPetals`), `TreeLeaves`, `WorldMaterial`, and `StrokeMaterial` shaders to the scene.\n       - Present the complete list of downloaded `.glb` and texture filenames from Step 1 to the user.\n\n2. **Progress**\n   - **Verified Previous Turn\'s 4 Team Buddies PS1 Features**:\n     - Ran unit tests (`npx --yes tsx --test src/game/rules.test.ts` \342\200\224 9/9 passing), `compile_applet` (succeeded), `restart_dev_server`, and verified in Playwright (`r6-clean-start-radar.png` and `r6-ghost-and-salute.png` inspected via `view_file` with 0 console errors, then cleaned up).\n   - **Completed LANGKAH 1 (100% Done)**:\n     - Opened `https://longhoang-lyo.com/` in Playwright with `request`/`response` listeners attached before navigation, clicked **\"LET\'S GO\"**, waited 10+ seconds, and logged all 125 asset URLs to `/extracted_lyo_assets/network_captured.json`.\n     - Downloaded all **52 model files** (48 `.glb` files + 4 `.json` track files) into `/extracted_lyo_assets/models/` and `/public/extracted_lyo_assets/models/`:\n       `barrel-1c.glb`, `barricade-1a.glb`, `bench.glb`, `boss-track-01.json`, `boss-track-02.json`, `boss.glb`, `brick.glb`, `bridge.glb`, `bts.glb`, `bullet.glb`, `chimney.glb`, `circuit.glb`, `concrete-fence-1a.glb`, `concrete-fence-1b.glb`, `concrete-pipe.glb`, `contact.glb`, `crane.glb`, `debris.glb`, `dump-truck.glb`, `explosive-barrel.glb`, `floor.glb`, `fodder-track.json`, `fodder.glb`, `forklift.glb`, `fuel.glb`, `gear.glb`, `giant-pipe-1a.glb`, `giant-pipe-1b.glb`, `giant-tank.glb`, `h-beam.glb`, `hydrant.glb`, `lamppost-1a.glb`, `lamppost-1b.glb`, `metal-box-1a.glb`, `metal-box-1b.glb`, `pallet-1a.glb`, `pipe-cluster-1a.glb`, `pipe-cluster-1b.glb`, `player-track.json`, `player.glb`, `power-core.glb`, `recycle-bin.glb`, `tank-1a.glb`, `tank-1b.glb`, `tools.glb`, `traffic-cone.glb`, `tree-1a.glb`, `tree-1b.glb`, `turbine.glb`, `wheelbarrow.glb`, `wooden-box.glb`, `zone.glb`.\n     - Downloaded all **40 texture/binary files** (`.ktx2`, `.bin`, `.webp`) into `/extracted_lyo_assets/textures/` and `/public/extracted_lyo_assets/textures/`:\n       `game-texture.ktx2`, `tree-foliage.ktx2`, `grass-mask.ktx2`, `grass-mask-128.bin`, `soil-mask.ktx2`, `tile-mask.ktx2`, `soil.ktx2`, `tile.ktx2`, `map-light.ktx2`, `locked-thumb.ktx2`, `track-mark.ktx2`, `debris.ktx2`, `decal-01.ktx2`, `decal-02.ktx2`, `flash.ktx2`, `ring.ktx2`, `smoke.ktx2`, `sphere.ktx2`, `star-01.ktx2`, `star-02.ktx2`, `star-burst.ktx2`, `stunned-effect.ktx2`, plus 18 `.webp` textures.\n     - Downloaded all **32 JS/WASM files** into `/extracted_lyo_assets/scripts/` and configured `/public/draco/` and `/public/basis/` decoders + `/public/extracted_lyo_assets/object/game-texture.ktx2`.\n   - **Completed LANGKAH 2 (100% Done)**:\n     - Decompiled `B1Nq4Kq6.js` and `CQl67Veh.js` and wrote the complete technical report to `/LYO_TECHNICAL_EXTRACTION.md`.\n   - **In Progress \342\200\224 LANGKAH 3 (~85% Done)**:\n     - Created `/src/game/lyoAssetsAndShaders.ts` implementing `loadAllRealLyoAssets` (`GLTFLoader` + `DRACOLoader` + `KTX2Loader`), `createLyoInfiniteGrassSystem` (`class Ni` port), `populateRealLyoTreeFromGlb` (`class Li` / `TreeLeaves` port), `populateRealLyoTankFromGlb` (real `player.glb` + mirrored wheels/covers + `player-track.json` 14-segment tracks), `spawnRealLyoPropFromGlb`, `upgradeMeshToLyoWorldMaterial` (`class Yn` port), and `createLyoStrokeMesh` (`class Nn` port).\n     - Updated lines 1\342\200\22335 and 517\342\200\223985 of `/src/game/FactoryPlaygroundCanvas.tsx` to instantiate `lyoGrassSystem`, load all real `.glb` assets, populate the 8 trees (`tree-1b.glb` & `tree-1a.glb`), populate tanks (`player.glb`), and place real Factory Playground `.glb` props (`power-core.glb`, `turbine.glb`, `hydrant.glb`, `explosive-barrel.glb`).\n     - **Remaining edit in `/src/game/FactoryPlaygroundCanvas.tsx`**: In the `animate` loop (around lines 1690\342\200\2231715) and cleanup block (around line 2530), replace the old `grassBucketIdx` / `grassInstanced` update with `windUniforms.uTime.value = timeSec; windUniforms.uWindPhase.value = timeSec * 4.8; windUniforms.uWindGust.value = 0.25 + 0.25 * Math.sin(timeSec * 1.7); lyoGrassSystem.update(...)` and call `isDisposed = true; lyoGrassSystem.dispose();` on unmount.\n\n3. **Key Findings**\n   - Every `.glb` model from `https://longhoang-lyo.com/` uses `KHR_draco_mesh_compression` and `KHR_texture_basisu` referencing `game-texture.ktx2` (`../object/game-texture.ktx2` or `game-texture.ktx2`). Using `LoadingManager.setURLModifier` + `DRACOLoader(\'/draco/\')` + `KTX2Loader(\'/basis/\')` loads both geometry and the KTX2 palette texture seamlessly.\n   - Inside `tree-1a.glb` and `tree-1b.glb`, `Tree_1A.REF` and `Tree_1B.REF` hold the trunk mesh and `Tree_Foliage.001..017` empty marker nodes where Lyo\'s `TreeLeaves` (`class Li`) attaches `planesPerCluster = 80` billboarded leaf cards sampled with `tree-foliage.ktx2`.\n   - Inside `player.glb`, only left wheels (`Left_Wheel_01..04`) and left track covers (`TrackCover_Left_01..03`) are stored; the right side is mirrored across `2 * bodyCenterZ - z` in code, and `Player_Track` is instanced 14 times per side along `player-track.json`.\n\n4. **Errors & Fixes**\n   - **Resolved**: `playwright-cli open ... --viewport` failed because `open` does not take `--viewport`; fixed by calling `playwright-cli resize 1280 800` after `open`.\n   - **Resolved**: `await import(\"node:fs\")` inside `playwright-cli run-code` threw `ERR_VM_DYNAMIC_IMPORT_CALLBACK_MISSING`; fixed by returning data from `run-code` to stdout and redirecting to a file.\n\n5. **Active Context**\n   - `/src/game/lyoAssetsAndShaders.ts` and `/LYO_TECHNICAL_EXTRACTION.md` are complete.\n   - `/src/game/FactoryPlaygroundCanvas.tsx` has `lyoGrassSystem` and `loadAllRealLyoAssets` wired up at scene init, and only needs the old `grassInstanced` loop reference at ~line 1700 replaced with `lyoGrassSystem.update(...)` and `isDisposed = true; lyoGrassSystem.dispose();` in the `useEffect` cleanup.\n\n6. **Next Steps**\n   1. View lines 1670\342\200\2231730 and 2500\342\200\2232565 of `/src/game/FactoryPlaygroundCanvas.tsx`.\n   2. Use `replace_file_content` on `/src/game/FactoryPlaygroundCanvas.tsx` to:\n      - Replace the old `grassBucketIdx` / `grassInstanced` loop in `animate()` with updating `windUniforms` (`uTime`, `uWindPhase`, `uWindGust`) and calling `lyoGrassSystem.update(...)`.\n      - Add `isDisposed = true; lyoGrassSystem.dispose();` to the `useEffect` cleanup return function.\n      - Remove any unused `matTreeTrunk` / `matTreeCanopy` variables if flagged by TypeScript.\n   3. Run `npx --yes tsx --test src/game/rules.test.ts` and `compile_applet` to verify 0 TypeScript/build errors.\n   4. Call `restart_dev_server` and run a `playwright-cli` verification session (`http://localhost:3000?autostart=1&tank=1`) waiting ~3 seconds for `GLTFLoader` + `DRACOLoader` + `KTX2Loader` to finish loading all `.glb` models, capture a screenshot (`.playwright-cli/r7-real-glb-lyo.png`), check `playwright-cli console error`, inspect the screenshot via `view_file` (`/.playwright-cli/r7-real-glb-lyo.png`) to confirm the real `.glb` trees (`tree-1b.glb` purple & `tree-1a.glb` golden), real `.glb` Lyo Tank (`player.glb`), real `.glb` Factory props (`power-core.glb`, `turbine.glb`, `hydrant.glb`, `explosive-barrel.glb`), and decompiled `InfiniteGrass` shader render cleanly, and then clean up temporary files (`rm -rf .playwright-cli extracted_lyo_assets/playwright_capture.txt`).\n   5. Present the complete list of downloaded `.glb` and `.ktx2`/`.bin`/`.webp` filenames from Step 1, along with a summary of the decompiled shaders in `LYO_TECHNICAL_EXTRACTION.md` and the Step 3 integration.\n\n7. **Commitments & Constraints**\n   - Follow `ultra-mode` verification discipline: compile, run unit tests, restart dev server, and inspect the live rendered browser screenshot via `view_file` before finishing.\n   - Maintain clean, concise UI text with no emojis or unrequested icons.\n</summary>"
