  planner_response {
    response: "Ekstraksi mendalam menggunakan **REA (Reverse Engineering Agent)** pada `https://longhoang-lyo.com/` telah dijalankan ulang sesuai ketiga langkah protokol.\n\n---\n\n### LANGKAH 1: Daftar Lengkap File `.glb` & Tekstur yang Tertangkap Setelah Klik `\"LET\'S GO\"`\n\nSeluruh 125 network request tercatat di `/extracted_lyo_assets/network_captured.json` setelah listener `page.on(\'response\')` dipasang sebelum navigasi dan tombol **\"LET\'S GO\"** diklik.\n\n#### A. File Model 3D di `/extracted_lyo_assets/models/` (52 File: 48 `.glb` + 4 `.json` Kurva Track)\n1. `barrel-1c.glb`\n2. `barricade-1a.glb`\n3. `bench.glb`\n4. `boss-track-01.json`\n5. `boss-track-02.json`\n6. `boss.glb`\n7. `brick.glb`\n8. `bridge.glb`\n9. `bts.glb`\n10. `bullet.glb`\n11. `chimney.glb`\n12. `circuit.glb`\n13. `concrete-fence-1a.glb`\n14. `concrete-fence-1b.glb`\n15. `concrete-pipe.glb`\n16. `contact.glb`\n17. `crane.glb`\n18. `debris.glb`\n19. `dump-truck.glb`\n20. `explosive-barrel.glb`\n21. `floor.glb`\n22. `fodder-track.json`\n23. `fodder.glb`\n24. `forklift.glb`\n25. `fuel.glb`\n26. `gear.glb`\n27. `giant-pipe-1a.glb`\n28. `giant-pipe-1b.glb`\n29. `giant-tank.glb`\n30. `h-beam.glb`\n31. `hydrant.glb`\n32. `lamppost-1a.glb`\n33. `lamppost-1b.glb`\n34. `metal-box-1a.glb`\n35. `metal-box-1b.glb`\n36. `pallet-1a.glb`\n37. `pipe-cluster-1a.glb`\n38. `pipe-cluster-1b.glb`\n39. `player-track.json`\n40. `player.glb`\n41. `power-core.glb`\n42. `recycle-bin.glb`\n43. `tank-1a.glb`\n44. `tank-1b.glb`\n45. `tools.glb`\n46. `traffic-cone.glb`\n47. `tree-1a.glb`\n48. `tree-1b.glb`\n49. `turbine.glb`\n50. `wheelbarrow.glb`\n51. `wooden-box.glb`\n52. `zone.glb`\n\n#### B. File Tekstur & Binary di `/extracted_lyo_assets/textures/` (40 File: 21 `.ktx2` + 1 `.bin` + 18 `.webp`)\n1. `debris.ktx2`\n2. `decal-01.ktx2`\n3. `decal-02.ktx2`\n4. `flash.ktx2`\n5. `game-texture.ktx2` (Atlas palet utama untuk seluruh model `.glb`)\n6. `grass-mask-128.bin` (Grid 128\303\227128 kepadatan rumput CPU/GPU)\n7. `grass-mask.ktx2`\n8. `locked-thumb.ktx2`\n9. `map-light.ktx2`\n10. `ring.ktx2`\n11. `smoke.ktx2`\n12. `soil-mask.ktx2`\n13. `soil.ktx2`\n14. `sphere.ktx2`\n15. `star-01.ktx2`\n16. `star-02.ktx2`\n17. `star-burst.ktx2`\n18. `stunned-effect.ktx2`\n19. `tile-mask.ktx2`\n20. `tile.ktx2`\n21. `track-mark.ktx2`\n22. `tree-foliage.ktx2` (Alpha mask untuk dedaunan `TreeLeaves`)\n23. `bts-01.webp` .. `bts-06.webp`\n24. `key-cap.webp`\n25. `p-01-thumb.webp` .. `p-09-thumb.webp`\n26. `paper-01.webp`, `paper-02.webp`\n\n---\n\n### LANGKAH 2: Dekompilasi Kode Shader TSL / Three.js (`/LYO_TECHNICAL_EXTRACTION.md`)\n\nSeluruh kode shader dan konfigurasi asli dari bundle `B1Nq4Kq6.js` dan `CQl67Veh.js` telah didekompilasi ke dalam `/LYO_TECHNICAL_EXTRACTION.md`, mencakup:\n- **Grass & Wind Shader (`class Ni` \342\200\224 `InfiniteGrass` & `InfiniteGrassPetals`):** Geometri bilah 3\303\2272 berlipat (`bladeFold = 0.5`), atribut instanced `aLocalAnchor`, `aRandom`, `aBladeShape`, palet gradasi 6 warna (`#1b6e1e`, `#75d424`, `#d1f542`, `#083d12`, `#1a7a24`, `#57b825`), kelopak bunga kuning (`#fff04a`/`#ffb300`) & ungu (`#b366ff`/`#8033cc`), serta fungsi gelombang angin dua lapis (`getWindOffset`).\n- **Foliage / Tree Shader (`class Li` \342\200\224 `TreeLeaves`):** Batang pohon dari `Tree_1B.REF` (`tree-1b.glb`) dan `Tree_1A.REF` (`tree-1a.glb`) dengan `planesPerCluster = 80` kartu daun billboard per marker `Tree_Foliage.*`, menggunakan alpha mask `tree-foliage.ktx2`, warna kanopi ungu (`#5e57a5` \342\206\222 `#775cf6`) dan emas (`#eab308` \342\206\222 `#facc15`), serta modulasi bayangan halftone 45\302\260.\n- **Tank Rig (`player.glb` + `player-track.json`) & Shader `WorldMaterial` (`class Yn`) / `StrokeMaterial` (`class Nn`):** Perakitan `Player_Body`, `Player_Turret`, `Player_Barrel`, pencerminan roda (`Left_Wheel_01..04`) dan penutup rantai (`TrackCover_Left_01..03`), serta 14 segmen rantai tank di sepanjang kurva `CatmullRomCurve3` dari `player-track.json`.\n\n---\n\n### LANGKAH 3: Integrasi Model `.glb` & Shader Asli ke Proyek (`/src/game/lyoAssetsAndShaders.ts` & `/src/game/FactoryPlaygroundCanvas.tsx`)\n\n- **Loader `.glb` + Draco + KTX2 (`loadAllRealLyoAssets`):** Memuat langsung file `.glb` terkompresi Draco dan tekstur BasisU `.ktx2` dari `/public/extracted_lyo_assets/`.\n- **Pohon, Tank, dan Prop Asli:** Mengganti geometri primitif pada pohon (`tree-1b.glb` & `tree-1a.glb`), kendaraan Lyo Tank (`player.glb` + `player-track.json`), serta elemen arena (`power-core.glb`, `turbine.glb`, `hydrant.glb`, `explosive-barrel.glb`) lengkap dengan shader `InfiniteGrass`, `TreeLeaves`, `WorldMaterial`, dan `StrokeMaterial`."
    modified_response: "Ekstraksi mendalam menggunakan **REA (Reverse Engineering Agent)** pada `https://longhoang-lyo.com/` telah dijalankan ulang sesuai ketiga langkah protokol.\n\n---\n\n### LANGKAH 1: Daftar Lengkap File `.glb` & Tekstur yang Tertangkap Setelah Klik `\"LET\'S GO\"`\n\nSeluruh 125 network request tercatat di `/extracted_lyo_assets/network_captured.json` setelah listener `page.on(\'response\')` dipasang sebelum navigasi dan tombol **\"LET\'S GO\"** diklik.\n\n#### A. File Model 3D di `/extracted_lyo_assets/models/` (52 File: 48 `.glb` + 4 `.json` Kurva Track)\n1. `barrel-1c.glb`\n2. `barricade-1a.glb`\n3. `bench.glb`\n4. `boss-track-01.json`\n5. `boss-track-02.json`\n6. `boss.glb`\n7. `brick.glb`\n8. `bridge.glb`\n9. `bts.glb`\n10. `bullet.glb`\n11. `chimney.glb`\n12. `circuit.glb`\n13. `concrete-fence-1a.glb`\n14. `concrete-fence-1b.glb`\n15. `concrete-pipe.glb`\n16. `contact.glb`\n17. `crane.glb`\n18. `debris.glb`\n19. `dump-truck.glb`\n20. `explosive-barrel.glb`\n21. `floor.glb`\n22. `fodder-track.json`\n23. `fodder.glb`\n24. `forklift.glb`\n25. `fuel.glb`\n26. `gear.glb`\n27. `giant-pipe-1a.glb`\n28. `giant-pipe-1b.glb`\n29. `giant-tank.glb`\n30. `h-beam.glb`\n31. `hydrant.glb`\n32. `lamppost-1a.glb`\n33. `lamppost-1b.glb`\n34. `metal-box-1a.glb`\n35. `metal-box-1b.glb`\n36. `pallet-1a.glb`\n37. `pipe-cluster-1a.glb`\n38. `pipe-cluster-1b.glb`\n39. `player-track.json`\n40. `player.glb`\n41. `power-core.glb`\n42. `recycle-bin.glb`\n43. `tank-1a.glb`\n44. `tank-1b.glb`\n45. `tools.glb`\n46. `traffic-cone.glb`\n47. `tree-1a.glb`\n48. `tree-1b.glb`\n49. `turbine.glb`\n50. `wheelbarrow.glb`\n51. `wooden-box.glb`\n52. `zone.glb`\n\n#### B. File Tekstur & Binary di `/extracted_lyo_assets/textures/` (40 File: 21 `.ktx2` + 1 `.bin` + 18 `.webp`)\n1. `debris.ktx2`\n2. `decal-01.ktx2`\n3. `decal-02.ktx2`\n4. `flash.ktx2`\n5. `game-texture.ktx2` (Atlas palet utama untuk seluruh model `.glb`)\n6. `grass-mask-128.bin` (Grid 128\303\227128 kepadatan rumput CPU/GPU)\n7. `grass-mask.ktx2`\n8. `locked-thumb.ktx2`\n9. `map-light.ktx2`\n10. `ring.ktx2`\n11. `smoke.ktx2`\n12. `soil-mask.ktx2`\n13. `soil.ktx2`\n14. `sphere.ktx2`\n15. `star-01.ktx2`\n16. `star-02.ktx2`\n17. `star-burst.ktx2`\n18. `stunned-effect.ktx2`\n19. `tile-mask.ktx2`\n20. `tile.ktx2`\n21. `track-mark.ktx2`\n22. `tree-foliage.ktx2` (Alpha mask untuk dedaunan `TreeLeaves`)\n23. `bts-01.webp` .. `bts-06.webp`\n24. `key-cap.webp`\n25. `p-01-thumb.webp` .. `p-09-thumb.webp`\n26. `paper-01.webp`, `paper-02.webp`\n\n---\n\n### LANGKAH 2: Dekompilasi Kode Shader TSL / Three.js (`/LYO_TECHNICAL_EXTRACTION.md`)\n\nSeluruh kode shader dan konfigurasi asli dari bundle `B1Nq4Kq6.js` dan `CQl67Veh.js` telah didekompilasi ke dalam `/LYO_TECHNICAL_EXTRACTION.md`, mencakup:\n- **Grass & Wind Shader (`class Ni` \342\200\224 `InfiniteGrass` & `InfiniteGrassPetals`):** Geometri bilah 3\303\2272 berlipat (`bladeFold = 0.5`), atribut instanced `aLocalAnchor`, `aRandom`, `aBladeShape`, palet gradasi 6 warna (`#1b6e1e`, `#75d424`, `#d1f542`, `#083d12`, `#1a7a24`, `#57b825`), kelopak bunga kuning (`#fff04a`/`#ffb300`) & ungu (`#b366ff`/`#8033cc`), serta fungsi gelombang angin dua lapis (`getWindOffset`).\n- **Foliage / Tree Shader (`class Li` \342\200\224 `TreeLeaves`):** Batang pohon dari `Tree_1B.REF` (`tree-1b.glb`) dan `Tree_1A.REF` (`tree-1a.glb`) dengan `planesPerCluster = 80` kartu daun billboard per marker `Tree_Foliage.*`, menggunakan alpha mask `tree-foliage.ktx2`, warna kanopi ungu (`#5e57a5` \342\206\222 `#775cf6`) dan emas (`#eab308` \342\206\222 `#facc15`), serta modulasi bayangan halftone 45\302\260.\n- **Tank Rig (`player.glb` + `player-track.json`) & Shader `WorldMaterial` (`class Yn`) / `StrokeMaterial` (`class Nn`):** Perakitan `Player_Body`, `Player_Turret`, `Player_Barrel`, pencerminan roda (`Left_Wheel_01..04`) dan penutup rantai (`TrackCover_Left_01..03`), serta 14 segmen rantai tank di sepanjang kurva `CatmullRomCurve3` dari `player-track.json`.\n\n---\n\n### LANGKAH 3: Integrasi Model `.glb` & Shader Asli ke Proyek (`/src/game/lyoAssetsAndShaders.ts` & `/src/game/FactoryPlaygroundCanvas.tsx`)\n\n- **Loader `.glb` + Draco + KTX2 (`loadAllRealLyoAssets`):** Memuat langsung file `.glb` terkompresi Draco dan tekstur BasisU `.ktx2` dari `/public/extracted_lyo_assets/`.\n- **Pohon, Tank, dan Prop Asli:** Mengganti geometri primitif pada pohon (`tree-1b.glb` & `tree-1a.glb`), kendaraan Lyo Tank (`player.glb` + `player-track.json`), serta elemen arena (`power-core.glb`, `turbine.glb`, `hydrant.glb`, `explosive-barrel.glb`) lengkap dengan shader `InfiniteGrass`, `TreeLeaves`, `WorldMaterial`, dan `StrokeMaterial`."
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
    thinking_signature: "\022\332\003\n\327\003\001i\024}\023\373o\375~l\244\344\3078\361\036\377\317\177\301\354\"\241\224\270\031\320\311w\250\230\220\275\271\232\247\276\006\037fR\204dH2\a&\223\v\321\224\203<\003K\340\330\"\260y*\23290K\b\203\364p\037\306\206.\244s\224,\375\350\036\350|qU\207{\247\231\337]\326u\215\2766\307\360\005\335\211\273\264\353P\'.\22260\362\306\236\301\375\337\335\037\302J\253\3337\031\254\355K\361O\354\254hQ\264\307\366\302\002ks\247EPs++\337g8\006\034\257\307\037q:\340\016\306R\374\327\2608\202\237\311\243\004\314\360\021\206\an\373T-\021\327\254t\241H\240\323\246\271l\232\205\031\232\302\252\363\277\270\220\273L\320m\244\307V\376\022I\344m\365\207\307\372crR\201t\366\342\036F\225\222\317O\334\034\311\216+j/w7\016\373M\214\370I\306RL#@\314\262\207\\\232\263\264\300w\353gI(O\254`\275\355\020\206fr\001\206hwz\035I\214\313\036g4\255\233\344\224|\335\273@W\246\305Uk\226/\371\352C\204yL0x]=\363\255\005\301.j\315\027\267\276A\017\2358\370\343\n\340\312\220X\347\374B\3103\035a\235\333\v\321l\364\353\2728+\272\241I^\274\373S\001\377\336\027\031\212\r\v\222r\003d\2414\257\255\332,\367nN\000)x\357\257\377\374A\'3\336\333$1\222nA\327I\220\367\267\324\257\033\300\354\005[\020\037\276\372}\350\373\001\373.\330\016(\2212%\315G%T\222u\341d9\214\325$\247\263\004\342\260\351\364/\334\344\314\352Y\212\020\243\261\253\356F\330]\371\316\322g\362R\rZ\376\224\274Y\247h\016x\200\020s\254"
