  checkpoint {
    checkpoint_index: 5
    session_summary: "<summary>\n1. **Task Overview**\n   - **Core Request:** Overhaul the game mode controls in `src/game/FactoryPlaygroundCanvas.tsx`, `src/game/lyoAssetsAndShaders.ts`, and `src/App.tsx` into **3 Separate Modes** switchable at any time via a **Toggle Switch in the Top Bar**:\n     1. **Mode 1 (Default on open): `SANDBOX TEST (NO NPC)`**\n        - **Disable/Remove All NPCs & AI:** Do NOT spawn Red enemies and do NOT move Allied Blue AI Buddies automatically. Bases must never be attacked on their own in this mode.\n        - **Focus on Player Mechanics Testing:** Player runs freely as a Buddy (`WASD`), picks up/throws Red & Blue Super Crates (`[E]`), stacks them on the `Stacking Pad 2x2x2`, presses `[F]` to craft Weapons or the real `player.glb` Lyo Tank, and mounts/dismounts the Tank (`[G]`) without enemy interference.\n        - **Quick Sandbox Action Buttons in UI:**\n          - `+ Drop Peti Merah`\n          - `+ Drop Peti Biru`\n          - `+ Spawn Lyo Tank di Depanku`\n     2. **Mode 2: `MAP EDITOR` (For Building & Arranging the Arena)**\n        - **Editor Camera (Top-Down / Wide Orbit Zoom):** Raise the camera high (`y \342\211\210 44`, `z \342\211\210 21`) so the entire map (Blue HQ, Red HQ, Dirt Roads, Drop Zones, and Trees) is clearly visible in one screen. Allow camera panning via middle/right-click drag or `WASD`, and zoom in/out with the mouse scroll wheel.\n        - **Lyo `.glb` Asset Placement Toolbar:** Side palette of objects to click-to-place onto the ground at the cursor point, right-click to delete, `R` to rotate, `[` and `]` to scale:\n          1. `Pohon Ungu Lyo` (`tree-1b.glb` + lush purple `TreeLeaves` foliage)\n          2. `Pohon Emas Lyo` (`tree-1a.glb` + lush yellow/gold `TreeLeaves` foliage)\n          3. `Kincir Angin` (`turbine.glb`)\n          4. `Power Core` (`power-core.glb`)\n          5. `Barikade / Pagar Beton` (`concrete-fence-1a.glb` & `barricade-1a.glb`)\n          6. `Tong Peledak & Hidran` (`explosive-barrel.glb` & `hydrant.glb`)\n          7. `Pindah Posisi Blue HQ / Red HQ / Stacking Pad / Crate Drop Zone` (reposition core arena structures by clicking on the ground)\n        - **Fix Tree Scale on Map:** Ensure all default trees (`tree-1b.glb` and `tree-1a.glb`) have a proportional height of **~8\342\200\22310 units** (much taller than the Buddy character) with lush purple/gold leaf canopies on their branches, and place several default trees near the player\'s starting area (`z \342\211\210 +10..+16`) so they are immediately visible!\n        - **Map Persistence Buttons:**\n          - `Simpan Layout Map` (save to `localStorage` under `\'lyo_arena_map_layout_v2\'`)\n          - `Reset Map Default`\n     3. **Mode 3: `RUN MATCH (WITH AI)`**\n        - Red Enemy NPCs and Allied Blue AI Buddies **ONLY** spawn and move when the player explicitly clicks `RUN MATCH (WITH AI)`.\n        - Switching back to `SANDBOX TEST` or `MAP EDITOR` immediately clears all AI NPCs and stops all attacks.\n\n2. **Progress**\n   - **Completed Edits (Ready for Build & Visual Verification):**\n     - **`/src/game/lyoAssetsAndShaders.ts`:**\n       - Updated `populateRealLyoTreeFromGlb` to accept `userScale = 1.0` and multiply `baseRefScale` (`0.4362676`) by `2.08 * userScale` (`~9.0` units tall, towering over the 2-unit Buddy character) with increased leaf cluster density (`planesPerCluster = 84`, `uLeafScale = 2.45`, `scl * 1.15`).\n       - Added `concreteFenceGltf` (`/extracted_lyo_assets/models/concrete-fence-1a.glb`) and `barricadeGltf` (`/extracted_lyo_assets/models/barricade-1a.glb`) to `LoadedLyoAssets` and `loadAllRealLyoAssets`.\n     - **`/src/game/FactoryPlaygroundCanvas.tsx`:**\n       - Added `PlayMode` (`\'sandbox\' | \'editor\' | \'match\'`), `EditorToolId`, `PlacedMapProp`, `ArenaMapLayout`, and `DEFAULT_ARENA_MAP_LAYOUT` (which places 8\342\200\22310 unit tall `tree-1b.glb` and `tree-1a.glb` trees near the player\'s starting area at `(-7.2, 11.4)`, `(7.2, 11.4)`, `(-12.4, 15.6)`, `(12.4, 15.6)`, plus mid-arena/northern trees and default Factory Playground `.glb` props).\n       - Implemented `rebuildMapFromLayout(layout)` and `spawnSingleMapProp(prop)` so all trees and `.glb` props (`tree_purple`, `tree_gold`, `turbine`, `power_core`, `concrete_fence`, `barricade`, `explosive_barrel`, `hydrant`) and core arena structures (`blueHq`, `bluePad`, `redHq`, `redPad`, `centerDropZone`) can be placed, rotated (`R`), scaled (`[` / `]`), deleted (Right-click / `Delete`), saved to `localStorage`, and reset to default.\n       - Implemented `applyPlayModeRef` and updated `spawnInitialSquadsAndObjects` + `animate()` so that in `\'sandbox\'` and `\'editor\'` modes, zero AI NPCs are spawned and bases are never attacked; AI squads only spawn and fight when `playMode === \'match\'`.\n       - Implemented Sandbox quick actions (`sandboxDropRedCrate`, `sandboxDropSuperCrate`, `sandboxSpawnTank`).\n     - **`/src/App.tsx`:**\n       - Set default `gameState` to `\'playing\'` (unless `?title=1` is passed) and default `playMode` to `\'sandbox\'` so `SANDBOX TEST (NO NPC)` is immediately active on first open.\n       - Added the Top Center **3-Mode Toggle Switch Bar** (`SANDBOX TEST (NO NPC)` | `MAP EDITOR` | `RUN MATCH (WITH AI)`).\n       - Added the **Sandbox Quick Test Bar** (`+ Drop Peti Merah`, `+ Drop Peti Biru`, `+ Spawn Lyo Tank di Depanku`) when `playMode === \'sandbox\'`.\n       - Added the **Map Editor Side Palette** (`PALET ASET LYO (.GLB)`, all 7 asset/structure categories, `[R] Putar`, `[ -` / `+ ]` scale buttons, `Hapus`, `Simpan Layout Map`, `Reset Map Default`) when `playMode === \'editor\'`.\n       - Removed the conflicting `KeyR` shortcut in `App.tsx` so `R` rotates objects in the Map Editor cleanly.\n\n3. **Key Findings**\n   - All `.glb` models required by the Map Editor (`tree-1b.glb`, `tree-1a.glb`, `turbine.glb`, `power-core.glb`, `concrete-fence-1a.glb`, `barricade-1a.glb`, `explosive-barrel.glb`, `hydrant.glb`, `player.glb`) are present in `/public/extracted_lyo_assets/models/`.\n\n4. **Errors & Fixes**\n   - Resolved `KeyR` collision in `src/App.tsx` where `KeyR` previously opened `ReaLuauModal`.\n   - Preserved the safe cloning pattern in `lyoAssetsAndShaders.ts` so `ShaderMaterial` uniforms are never stored inside `mesh.userData`.\n\n5. **Active Context**\n   - Code edits to `/src/game/lyoAssetsAndShaders.ts`, `/src/game/FactoryPlaygroundCanvas.tsx`, and `/src/App.tsx` are complete.\n   - Next step is to run `compile_applet`, run unit tests, and visually verify all 3 modes in Playwright.\n\n6. **Next Steps**\n   1. Run `compile_applet` to verify there are no TypeScript or build errors.\n   2. Run `npx --yes tsx --test src/game/rules.test.ts` to verify all unit tests pass.\n   3. Restart the dev server (`restart_dev_server`) and use `playwright-cli` (`computer-use` skill) to:\n      - Open `http://localhost:3000` and verify `SANDBOX TEST (NO NPC)` is active by default with tall 8\342\200\22310 unit Lyo purple/golden trees visible near the player, 0 enemy NPCs, and working `+ Drop Peti Merah`, `+ Drop Peti Biru`, and `+ Spawn Lyo Tank di Depanku` buttons (capture screenshot & inspect with `view_file`).\n      - Click `MAP EDITOR` (`[data-mode-btn=\"editor\"]`), verify the high top-down overview camera and `.glb` asset palette, test placing a prop and clicking `Simpan Layout Map` (capture screenshot & inspect with `view_file`).\n      - Click `RUN MATCH (WITH AI)` (`[data-mode-btn=\"match\"]`), verify Allied and Red Enemy AI Buddies spawn and move, and verify `playwright-cli console` has 0 errors.\n\n7. **Commitments & Constraints**\n   - Keep UI labels concise and clean without unnecessary text bloat.\n   - Ensure all 3 modes (`SANDBOX TEST (NO NPC)`, `MAP EDITOR`, `RUN MATCH (WITH AI)`) work seamlessly with 0 console/runtime errors.\n</summary>"
