  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Analyzing File Referencing**\n\nI\'ve been looking closely at the reference strings within Lyo\'s `.glb` files. Each one consistently uses a similar pattern. It seems a numerical ID, followed by a colon, and then a reference name. I\'ve noted a few key examples. This consistency is quite interesting, and offers a clear structure.\n\n\n**Investigating Naming Conventions**\n\nI\'ve discovered an issue with how Three.js handles node names in the `.glb` files. The `PropertyBinding.sanitizeNodeName` function removes periods from node names, causing a problem in identifying reference nodes, because I was originally checking for `n.endsWith(\'.ref\') || n.endsWith(\'_ref\')`. It misses all of the `.REF` nodes! I\'ve found examples like `WindTurbine.REF` becoming `\"WindTurbineREF\"`. Also, I\'ve noted that some numerical IDs might denote placement markers instead of the primary asset, like with `0:WindTurbine.004` versus `6:WindTurbine.REF` in `turbine.glb`.\n\n\n**Refining Asset Scaling**\n\nI\'m now focusing on scaling for various assets. I\'ve been experimenting with `baseRefScale` and `userScale` to achieve the right proportions. For example, for `.REF` trees, I\'m matching tree names, applying a specific `refScale` and `uLeafScale` to create a lush canopy. For other props, I\'m excluding \"pc\\_monitor\" and adjusting scale based on `maxSpan`. So far, results are promising.\n\n\n**Implementing Sandbox Refinements**\n\nI\'ve been working on refining the sandbox experience. I\'ve offset the red crate, super crate, and tank spawns so they appear side-by-side. I\'ve also hidden the pad status and prompt sprites in map editor mode, and adjusted the initial camera position for a clearer view. I\'ve added attributes to the save and reset buttons in `App.tsx` for improved editor functionality.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_125019"
      name: "replace_file_content"
      arguments_json: "{\"AllowMultiple\":false, \"Description\":\"Fix .REF node matching in populateRealLyoTreeFromGlb and spawnRealLyoPropFromGlb so all 9 Tree_Foliage branch canopies and .REF prop meshes load accurately\", \"EndLine\":895, \"Instruction\":\"Update populateRealLyoTreeFromGlb in src/game/lyoAssetsAndShaders.ts to match sanitized .REF node names (endsWith(\'ref\')) and scale branch foliage clusters proportionally across all branches\", \"ReplacementContent\":\"  // Locate ONLY the single reference tree root (Tree_1B.REF / Tree_1BREF or Tree_1A.REF / Tree_1AREF)\\n  let refRoot: THREE.Object3D | null = null;\\n  treeGltfScene.traverse((obj) => {\\n    const n = (obj.name || \'\').toLowerCase();\\n    if (!refRoot && n.endsWith(\'ref\')) {\\n      refRoot = obj;\\n    }\\n  });\\n  const sourceRoot = (refRoot || treeGltfScene.children[0] || treeGltfScene) as THREE.Object3D;\\n\\n  const trunkGroup = new THREE.Group();\\n  trunkGroup.name = \'RealGlbTreeTrunk\';\\n  const baseRefScale = sourceRoot.scale.x > 0.01 ? sourceRoot.scale.x : 0.4362676;\\n  // Scale default Lyo trees to ~8.8-9.5 units tall (8-10 units, towering over the 2-unit Buddy character)\\n  const refScale = baseRefScale * 1.75 * userScale;\\n\\n  // 1. Clone ONLY the reference trunk mesh itself (sourceRoot is a Mesh in tree-1b.glb / tree-1a.glb)\\n  if ((sourceRoot as THREE.Mesh).isMesh) {\\n    const srcTrunk = sourceRoot as THREE.Mesh;\\n    const trunkMesh = new THREE.Mesh(srcTrunk.geometry, srcTrunk.material);\\n    trunkMesh.name = srcTrunk.name;\\n    trunkMesh.scale.setScalar(refScale);\\n    trunkMesh.castShadow = !isSoftwareGl;\\n    trunkMesh.receiveShadow = !isSoftwareGl;\\n    upgradeMeshToLyoWorldMaterial(trunkMesh, windUniforms);\\n    const stroke = createLyoStrokeMesh(trunkMesh.geometry, 0.042);\\n    if (stroke) trunkMesh.add(stroke);\\n    trunkGroup.add(trunkMesh);\\n  }\\n\\n  // 2. Collect the Tree_Foliage.* cluster marker transforms from sourceRoot\'s children\\n  const foliageMarkerMatrices: THREE.Matrix4[] = [];\\n  sourceRoot.traverse((child) => {\\n    if (child === sourceRoot) return;\\n    const lower = (child.name || \'\').toLowerCase();\\n    if (lower.startsWith(\'tree_foliage\') || lower.includes(\'foliage\')) {\\n      const m = new THREE.Matrix4();\\n      const pos = child.position.clone().multiplyScalar(refScale);\\n      const scl = child.scale.clone().multiplyScalar(refScale * 0.68);\\n      m.compose(pos, child.quaternion, scl);\\n      foliageMarkerMatrices.push(m);\\n    }\\n  });\\n\\n  // Ground trunk cleanly at y = 0\\n  const box = new THREE.Box3().setFromObject(trunkGroup);\\n  if (!box.isEmpty()) {\\n    trunkGroup.position.y = -box.min.y;\\n  }\\n  targetGroup.add(trunkGroup);\\n\\n  // 3. Build exact Lyo TreeLeaves geometry (planesPerCluster = 80, planeSize = 0.85, normalLerp = 0.85)\\n  const planesPerCluster = isSoftwareGl ? 64 : 84;\\n  const planeSize = 0.85;\\n  const normalLerp = 0.85;\\n  let randomSeed = 1431691;\\n  const getRandom = () => {\\n    randomSeed = (randomSeed * 1664525 + 1013904223) >>> 0;\\n    return randomSeed / 4294967296;\\n  };\\n\\n  const clusterGeos: THREE.BufferGeometry[] = [];\\n  const leafCenters = new Float32Array(planesPerCluster * 4 * 3);\\n  const leafLocalPos = new Float32Array(planesPerCluster * 4 * 3);\\n  const leafPlaneSeed = new Float32Array(planesPerCluster * 4);\\n\\n  for (let a = 0; a < planesPerCluster; a++) {\\n    const plane = new THREE.PlaneGeometry(planeSize, planeSize);\\n    const seed = getRandom();\\n    const radius = 1 - Math.pow(getRandom(), 3);\\n    const phi = Math.PI * 2 * getRandom();\\n    const theta = Math.PI * getRandom();\\n    const sph = new THREE.Spherical(radius, theta, phi);\\n    const center = new THREE.Vector3().setFromSpherical(sph);\\n    const radialNormal = center.clone().normalize();\\n\\n    const posAttr = plane.attributes.position;\\n    const normAttr = plane.attributes.normal;\\n    for (let v = 0; v < 4; v++) {\\n      const vertIdx = a * 4 + v;\\n      const s3 = v * 3;\\n      const f3 = vertIdx * 3;\\n      const p = new THREE.Vector3(posAttr.array[s3], posAttr.array[s3 + 1], posAttr.array[s3 + 2]);\\n      leafCenters[f3] = center.x;\\n      leafCenters[f3 + 1] = center.y;\\n      leafCenters[f3 + 2] = center.z;\\n      leafLocalPos[f3] = p.x;\\n      leafLocalPos[f3 + 1] = p.y;\\n      leafLocalPos[f3 + 2] = p.z;\\n      leafPlaneSeed[vertIdx] = seed;\\n\\n      const blendedNormal = p.clone().lerp(radialNormal, normalLerp).normalize();\\n      normAttr.array[s3] = blendedNormal.x;\\n      normAttr.array[s3 + 1] = blendedNormal.y;\\n      normAttr.array[s3 + 2] = blendedNormal.z;\\n    }\\n    clusterGeos.push(plane);\\n  }\\n\\n  const mergedClusterGeo = mergeGeometries(clusterGeos, false);\\n  clusterGeos.forEach((g) => g.dispose());\\n  mergedClusterGeo.setAttribute(\'aLeafCenter\', new THREE.BufferAttribute(leafCenters, 3));\\n  mergedClusterGeo.setAttribute(\'aLeafLocalPos\', new THREE.BufferAttribute(leafLocalPos, 3));\\n  mergedClusterGeo.setAttribute(\'aLeafPlaneSeed\', new THREE.BufferAttribute(leafPlaneSeed, 1));\\n\\n  // Exact colors from Ri.prototype.instanceObjectOverrides (B1Nq4Kq6.js:442500):\\n  // Tree_1B: colorA = \'#5e57a5\', colorB = \'#775cf6\', leafScale = 1.45\\n  // Tree_1A: colorA = \'#eab308\', colorB = \'#facc15\', leafScale = 1.45\\n  const colorA = new THREE.Color(isPurpleTree ? \'#5e57a5\' : \'#eab308\');\\n  const colorB = new THREE.Color(isPurpleTree ? \'#775cf6\' : \'#facc15\');\\n\\n  const foliageMaterial = new THREE.ShaderMaterial({\\n    uniforms: {\\n      uLeafTex: { value: leafMaskTexture },\\n      uColorA: { value: colorA },\\n      uColorB: { value: colorB },\\n      uLeafScale: { value: 1.45 },\", \"StartLine\":772, \"TargetContent\":\"  // Locate ONLY the single reference tree root (Tree_1B.REF / Tree_1B_REF or Tree_1A.REF / Tree_1A_REF)\\n  let refRoot: THREE.Object3D | null = null;\\n  treeGltfScene.traverse((obj) => {\\n    const n = (obj.name || \'\').toLowerCase();\\n    if (!refRoot && (n.endsWith(\'.ref\') || n.endsWith(\'_ref\'))) {\\n      refRoot = obj;\\n    }\\n  });\\n  const sourceRoot = (refRoot || treeGltfScene.children[0] || treeGltfScene) as THREE.Object3D;\\n\\n  const trunkGroup = new THREE.Group();\\n  trunkGroup.name = \'RealGlbTreeTrunk\';\\n  const baseRefScale = sourceRoot.scale.x > 0.01 ? sourceRoot.scale.x : 0.4362676;\\n  // Scale default Lyo trees to ~9.0 units tall (8-10 units, towering over the 2-unit Buddy character)\\n  const refScale = baseRefScale * 2.08 * userScale;\\n\\n  // 1. Clone ONLY the reference trunk mesh itself (sourceRoot is a Mesh in tree-1b.glb / tree-1a.glb)\\n  if ((sourceRoot as THREE.Mesh).isMesh) {\\n    const srcTrunk = sourceRoot as THREE.Mesh;\\n    const trunkMesh = new THREE.Mesh(srcTrunk.geometry, srcTrunk.material);\\n    trunkMesh.name = srcTrunk.name;\\n    trunkMesh.scale.setScalar(refScale);\\n    trunkMesh.castShadow = !isSoftwareGl;\\n    trunkMesh.receiveShadow = !isSoftwareGl;\\n    upgradeMeshToLyoWorldMaterial(trunkMesh, windUniforms);\\n    const stroke = createLyoStrokeMesh(trunkMesh.geometry, 0.042);\\n    if (stroke) trunkMesh.add(stroke);\\n    trunkGroup.add(trunkMesh);\\n  }\\n\\n  // 2. Collect the Tree_Foliage.* cluster marker transforms from sourceRoot\'s direct children\\n  const foliageMarkerMatrices: THREE.Matrix4[] = [];\\n  sourceRoot.children.forEach((child) => {\\n    const lower = (child.name || \'\').toLowerCase();\\n    if (lower.startsWith(\'tree_foliage\') || lower.includes(\'foliage\')) {\\n      const m = new THREE.Matrix4();\\n      const pos = child.position.clone().multiplyScalar(refScale);\\n      const scl = child.scale.clone().multiplyScalar(refScale * 1.15);\\n      m.compose(pos, child.quaternion, scl);\\n      foliageMarkerMatrices.push(m);\\n    }\\n  });\\n\\n  // Ground trunk cleanly at y = 0\\n  const box = new THREE.Box3().setFromObject(trunkGroup);\\n  if (!box.isEmpty()) {\\n    trunkGroup.position.y = -box.min.y;\\n  }\\n  targetGroup.add(trunkGroup);\\n\\n  // 3. Build exact Lyo TreeLeaves geometry (planesPerCluster = 80, planeSize = 0.85, normalLerp = 0.85)\\n  const planesPerCluster = isSoftwareGl ? 64 : 84;\\n  const planeSize = 0.86;\\n  const normalLerp = 0.85;\\n  let randomSeed = 1431691;\\n  const getRandom = () => {\\n    randomSeed = (randomSeed * 1664525 + 1013904223) >>> 0;\\n    return randomSeed / 4294967296;\\n  };\\n\\n  const clusterGeos: THREE.BufferGeometry[] = [];\\n  const leafCenters = new Float32Array(planesPerCluster * 4 * 3);\\n  const leafLocalPos = new Float32Array(planesPerCluster * 4 * 3);\\n  const leafPlaneSeed = new Float32Array(planesPerCluster * 4);\\n\\n  for (let a = 0; a < planesPerCluster; a++) {\\n    const plane = new THREE.PlaneGeometry(planeSize, planeSize);\\n    const seed = getRandom();\\n    const radius = 1 - Math.pow(getRandom(), 3);\\n    const phi = Math.PI * 2 * getRandom();\\n    const theta = Math.PI * getRandom();\\n    const sph = new THREE.Spherical(radius, theta, phi);\\n    const center = new THREE.Vector3().setFromSpherical(sph);\\n    const radialNormal = center.clone().normalize();\\n\\n    const posAttr = plane.attributes.position;\\n    const normAttr = plane.attributes.normal;\\n    for (let v = 0; v < 4; v++) {\\n      const vertIdx = a * 4 + v;\\n      const s3 = v * 3;\\n      const f3 = vertIdx * 3;\\n      const p = new THREE.Vector3(posAttr.array[s3], posAttr.array[s3 + 1], posAttr.array[s3 + 2]);\\n      leafCenters[f3] = center.x;\\n      leafCenters[f3 + 1] = center.y;\\n      leafCenters[f3 + 2] = center.z;\\n      leafLocalPos[f3] = p.x;\\n      leafLocalPos[f3 + 1] = p.y;\\n      leafLocalPos[f3 + 2] = p.z;\\n      leafPlaneSeed[vertIdx] = seed;\\n\\n      const blendedNormal = p.clone().lerp(radialNormal, normalLerp).normalize();\\n      normAttr.array[s3] = blendedNormal.x;\\n      normAttr.array[s3 + 1] = blendedNormal.y;\\n      normAttr.array[s3 + 2] = blendedNormal.z;\\n    }\\n    clusterGeos.push(plane);\\n  }\\n\\n  const mergedClusterGeo = mergeGeometries(clusterGeos, false);\\n  clusterGeos.forEach((g) => g.dispose());\\n  mergedClusterGeo.setAttribute(\'aLeafCenter\', new THREE.BufferAttribute(leafCenters, 3));\\n  mergedClusterGeo.setAttribute(\'aLeafLocalPos\', new THREE.BufferAttribute(leafLocalPos, 3));\\n  mergedClusterGeo.setAttribute(\'aLeafPlaneSeed\', new THREE.BufferAttribute(leafPlaneSeed, 1));\\n\\n  // Exact colors from Ri.prototype.instanceObjectOverrides (B1Nq4Kq6.js:442500):\\n  // Tree_1B: colorA = \'#5e57a5\', colorB = \'#775cf6\', leafScale = 2.45\\n  // Tree_1A: colorA = \'#eab308\', colorB = \'#facc15\', leafScale = 2.45\\n  const colorA = new THREE.Color(isPurpleTree ? \'#5e57a5\' : \'#eab308\');\\n  const colorB = new THREE.Color(isPurpleTree ? \'#775cf6\' : \'#facc15\');\\n\\n  const foliageMaterial = new THREE.ShaderMaterial({\\n    uniforms: {\\n      uLeafTex: { value: leafMaskTexture },\\n      uColorA: { value: colorA },\\n      uColorB: { value: colorB },\\n      uLeafScale: { value: 2.45 },\", \"TargetFile\":\"/src/game/lyoAssetsAndShaders.ts\", \"toolAction\":\"Updating tree foliage branch cluster matching in lyoAssetsAndShaders.ts\", \"toolSummary\":\"Update tree foliage matching\"}"
      thinking_signature: "\022\321!\n\316!\001i\024}\023V\245D\241u\321 \243I\272\326\354\311\375\373T)\252\212\215\251\361\217c\035\266z\220k\245\255\205}\265J\362\217\310\322Z-\342n\234\352\371Z\2267\036%\354\035p\360\370\234\242D\264=\016\360\"\317a\257G\345\236~&\022b\177\326\277=^,\277\361\005r\256\265\234)l\2158m0\332\314\363\330\v\265\344tD\243\322\321^\251\221\275\326v\263\004\302\222.\305|gK;\300\265y35\240;\206\202\035\350\331\227L\365Qx!\016H\247F-\b1\250\333|1\365\321\214\255\333|\260\375\307\230\226XhF\246\350\244\374\201\211\243\302Za\300\263c\371\274p\254\377vP\261\236Y\227\364\274\351\024\337\252\331\3571N\205\375H\263F\370K\217\226\375\226\233g\266\367\353o\223\331\250\303s\372\357\240\231H(\0352k\221\001\b\232U\356$\276s\026\221UI9\324j\r\244\t\242I:y\322\204\f\354\273=\237|\207*\226\027&\346{\364*!\327\234\364O\345\355Q\202\305\351\317\366\345\246\323\024\024\312Lp\234\"\32785\357\201\024\031\217odS=\202fY\230\316\347\354\273\002\203\330\242\334@\321\275\3100\251\267\035\323XC\241\203:a\177~\220?\2643la~\330\223c\026w\003\231\340r\254\363v#\364\a\tr\236\341\231\343\2654\233\"\323\277\fn\003\264]\020\"iY\371p5\242\323\036YN\364o#\275p\002,d\372%\204Kl\2030\344\344\274\332\336\267\032i\335\364-@\242\226\274O\267\251\374\244:\f\375?\335\002l\371\353\227\316\363\306T\305\016\243R\206\304\211F\347\b\200\327\303AeJ\332\251\036\235/g\201\263;\203\247\177\332\315\3032\371\343d@\022u\263\316\244\230f\265\235T\322\260\331[\374\221m\203\264\'r;I\023\344\260\211\315]\220\036l\357\344\002e\244x\201 \377l\341\242u\345\a\n\027a\244\270\356\250\025\345\262\372c\373R\325\322P\320J5\317R\234\036,vL\031HY\233\277\251\037F|D\200V\273\255\273>\033rx\375J(\357Zn\'DF<Z\362~Wh)\200\357\"J\261Z\203\231E\324m.\307\276\372\242\324\217\272ID\264\366\363\r\363~\026\253\325n~\363\360+\205_vc\243\006\372|xd+\342`\304@\\[u_\373\275\0170y0\\kK%2i\277\342\340fs6m$\371\3168\035\264\b\265\266Let\343\300\362\254\0340\270\335\324&\314+\321\364P\274\341\003eB.\023\001Mq\376\234\033\"\