  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Analyzing Sign Placement**\n\nI\'ve been examining the sign placement in the FactoryPlaygroundCanvas. Specifically, I\'m noting the differing y-axis values for hpSign and padSign at lines 756 and 838, respectively. Also, I need to check the DEFAULT_ARENA_MAP_LAYOUT to find the `blueHq`.\n\n\n**Revising Arena Layout**\n\nI\'ve decided to move the `bluePad` to `{ x: -6.0, z: 8.8 }` and `blueHq` to `{ x: 8.2, z: 8.8 }`. This places them ahead of the player at `z = 12.5`, resulting in better camera framing. I\'m also scaling down the `hpSign` and `padSign` billboards to `3.0, 0.75` and repositioning them at `y = 5.4` and `y = 3.2`, respectively, for a cleaner look. Additionally, I plan to update the `onBluePad` grass cutout to match the new coordinates. Finally, I\'ll update the `MAP_STORAGE_KEY` to `\'lyo_arena_map_layout_v4\'`.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_99979"
      name: "multi_replace_file_content"
      arguments_json: "{\"Description\":\"Place Blue HQ and Blue Stacking Pad at z = 8.8 in front of the player and make 3D billboard signs compact so they sit cleanly in the midrange without clipping the low-angle camera edges\", \"Instruction\":\"Update DEFAULT_ARENA_MAP_LAYOUT and billboard sign sizes in /src/game/FactoryPlaygroundCanvas.tsx\", \"ReplacementChunks\":[{\"AllowMultiple\":false, \"EndLine\":115, \"ReplacementContent\":\"export const MAP_STORAGE_KEY = \'lyo_arena_map_layout_v4\';\\n\\nexport const DEFAULT_ARENA_MAP_LAYOUT: ArenaMapLayout = {\\n  // Positioned in the midrange flanking the central road so the low-angle chase camera frames Pad, HQ, Purple Trees, and Sky Horizon cleanly\\n  blueHq: { x: 8.4, z: 8.6 },\\n  bluePad: { x: -6.0, z: 8.8 },\\n  redHq: { x: -8.4, z: -16.5 },\\n  redPad: { x: 6.2, z: -16.5 },\\n  centerDropZone: { x: 0, z: 0 },\\n  props: [\\n    // Prominent 8-10 unit tall Purple & Gold Lyo Trees framing the road and rising into the top 25%-30% warm sky horizon\\n    { id: 101, kind: \'tree_purple\', x: -7.4, z: 3.8, rotY: 0.2, scale: 1.12 },\\n    { id: 102, kind: \'tree_purple\', x: 7.4, z: 3.8, rotY: -0.4, scale: 1.12 },\\n    { id: 103, kind: \'tree_gold\', x: -12.8, z: 10.5, rotY: 1.1, scale: 1.08 },\\n    { id: 104, kind: \'tree_purple\', x: 13.2, z: 11.2, rotY: -0.8, scale: 1.08 },\\n    // Mid-arena & Horizon Purple/Gold Lyo Trees\\n    { id: 105, kind: \'tree_purple\', x: -9.8, z: -3.5, rotY: 0.5, scale: 1.15 },\\n    { id: 106, kind: \'tree_gold\', x: 9.8, z: -3.5, rotY: -0.6, scale: 1.1 },\\n    { id: 107, kind: \'tree_purple\', x: -8.2, z: -11.2, rotY: 0.8, scale: 1.18 },\\n    { id: 108, kind: \'tree_purple\', x: 8.2, z: -11.2, rotY: -0.3, scale: 1.18 },\\n    { id: 109, kind: \'tree_purple\', x: -16.8, z: 4.5, rotY: 0.0, scale: 1.15 },\\n    { id: 110, kind: \'tree_gold\', x: 16.8, z: 4.5, rotY: 1.5, scale: 1.12 },\\n    { id: 111, kind: \'tree_purple\', x: -15.5, z: -14.5, rotY: -1.2, scale: 1.2 },\\n    { id: 112, kind: \'tree_purple\', x: 15.5, z: -14.5, rotY: 0.7, scale: 1.2 },\\n    { id: 113, kind: \'tree_purple\', x: -4.8, z: -22.5, rotY: 0.3, scale: 1.22 },\\n    { id: 114, kind: \'tree_gold\', x: 4.8, z: -22.5, rotY: -0.5, scale: 1.18 },\\n    // Default Factory Playground .glb Props\\n    { id: 201, kind: \'power_core\', x: 4.6, z: 11.4, rotY: -Math.PI / 5, scale: 1.0 },\\n    { id: 202, kind: \'turbine\', x: -14.5, z: -2.2, rotY: 0.3, scale: 1.05 },\\n    { id: 203, kind: \'turbine\', x: 14.5, z: -2.2, rotY: -2.5, scale: 1.05 },\\n    { id: 204, kind: \'concrete_fence\', x: -4.8, z: 4.8, rotY: 0, scale: 1.0 },\\n    { id: 205, kind: \'barricade\', x: 4.8, z: 4.8, rotY: 0, scale: 1.0 },\\n    { id: 206, kind: \'hydrant\', x: -3.8, z: 3.6, rotY: 0, scale: 1.0 },\\n    { id: 207, kind: \'explosive_barrel\', x: 4.0, z: 3.6, rotY: 0.4, scale: 1.0 },\\n  ],\\n};\", \"StartLine\":79, \"TargetContent\":\"export const MAP_STORAGE_KEY = \'lyo_arena_map_layout_v3\';\\n\\nexport const DEFAULT_ARENA_MAP_LAYOUT: ArenaMapLayout = {\\n  // Positioned alongside the central road so the low-angle chase camera behind the player has an unobstructed horizon view\\n  blueHq: { x: 7.8, z: 15.0 },\\n  bluePad: { x: -6.2, z: 15.0 },\\n  redHq: { x: -7.8, z: -16.5 },\\n  redPad: { x: 6.2, z: -16.5 },\\n  centerDropZone: { x: 0, z: 0 },\\n  props: [\\n    // Prominent 8-10 unit tall Purple & Gold Lyo Trees framing the road and rising into the top 25%-30% warm sky horizon\\n    { id: 101, kind: \'tree_purple\', x: -6.4, z: 9.8, rotY: 0.2, scale: 1.08 },\\n    { id: 102, kind: \'tree_purple\', x: 6.4, z: 9.8, rotY: -0.4, scale: 1.08 },\\n    { id: 103, kind: \'tree_gold\', x: -12.2, z: 13.5, rotY: 1.1, scale: 1.05 },\\n    { id: 104, kind: \'tree_purple\', x: 12.2, z: 13.5, rotY: -0.8, scale: 1.05 },\\n    // Mid-arena & Horizon Purple/Gold Lyo Trees\\n    { id: 105, kind: \'tree_purple\', x: -9.2, z: 2.5, rotY: 0.5, scale: 1.12 },\\n    { id: 106, kind: \'tree_gold\', x: 9.2, z: 2.5, rotY: -0.6, scale: 1.08 },\\n    { id: 107, kind: \'tree_purple\', x: -8.6, z: -8.8, rotY: 0.8, scale: 1.15 },\\n    { id: 108, kind: \'tree_purple\', x: 8.6, z: -8.8, rotY: -0.3, scale: 1.15 },\\n    { id: 109, kind: \'tree_purple\', x: -16.8, z: 5.5, rotY: 0.0, scale: 1.15 },\\n    { id: 110, kind: \'tree_gold\', x: 16.8, z: 5.5, rotY: 1.5, scale: 1.12 },\\n    { id: 111, kind: \'tree_purple\', x: -15.5, z: -14.5, rotY: -1.2, scale: 1.2 },\\n    { id: 112, kind: \'tree_purple\', x: 15.5, z: -14.5, rotY: 0.7, scale: 1.2 },\\n    { id: 113, kind: \'tree_purple\', x: -4.8, z: -22.5, rotY: 0.3, scale: 1.22 },\\n    { id: 114, kind: \'tree_gold\', x: 4.8, z: -22.5, rotY: -0.5, scale: 1.18 },\\n    // Default Factory Playground .glb Props\\n    { id: 201, kind: \'power_core\', x: 5.2, z: 11.8, rotY: -Math.PI / 5, scale: 1.0 },\\n    { id: 202, kind: \'turbine\', x: -14.5, z: -2.2, rotY: 0.3, scale: 1.05 },\\n    { id: 203, kind: \'turbine\', x: 14.5, z: -2.2, rotY: -2.5, scale: 1.05 },\\n    { id: 204, kind: \'concrete_fence\', x: -5.2, z: 6.8, rotY: 0, scale: 1.0 },\\n    { id: 205, kind: \'barricade\', x: 5.2, z: 6.8, rotY: 0, scale: 1.0 },\\n    { id: 206, kind: \'hydrant\', x: -4.2, z: 5.2, rotY: 0, scale: 1.0 },\\n    { id: 207, kind: \'explosive_barrel\', x: 4.4, z: 5.2, rotY: 0.4, scale: 1.0 },\\n  ],\\n};\"}, {\"AllowMultiple\":false, \"EndLine\":760, \"ReplacementContent\":\"      const hpSign = createBillboardSign(3.1, 0.78);\\n      hpSign.sprite.position.set(0, 5.35, 0);\\n      baseGroup.add(hpSign.sprite);\", \"StartLine\":755, \"TargetContent\":\"      const hpSign = createBillboardSign(5.5, 1.35);\\n      hpSign.sprite.position.set(0, 6.1, 0);\\n      baseGroup.add(hpSign.sprite);\"}, {\"AllowMultiple\":false, \"EndLine\":860, \"ReplacementContent\":\"      const padSign = createBillboardSign(3.1, 0.78);\\n      padSign.sprite.position.set(0, 3.35, 0);\\n      padGroup.add(padSign.sprite);\\n\\n      return {\\n        baseGroup,\\n        hpSign,\\n        padGroup,\\n        hqX,\\n        hqZ,\\n        padX,\\n        padZ,\\n        slotMeshes,\\n        ghostSlotMeshes,\\n        ghostPatternBox,\\n        mergedCage,\\n        padSign,\\n      };\\n    };\\n\\n    const blueBase = buildBaseHqAndPad(\'blue\', 8.4, 8.6, -6.0, 8.8);\\n    const redBase = buildBaseHqAndPad(\'red\', -8.4, -16.5, 6.2, -16.5);\", \"StartLine\":837, \"TargetContent\":\"      const padSign = createBillboardSign(5.8, 1.42);\\n      padSign.sprite.position.set(0, 4.5, 0);\\n      padGroup.add(padSign.sprite);\\n\\n      return {\\n        baseGroup,\\n        hpSign,\\n        padGroup,\\n        hqX,\\n        hqZ,\\n        padX,\\n        padZ,\\n        slotMeshes,\\n        ghostSlotMeshes,\\n        ghostPatternBox,\\n        mergedCage,\\n        padSign,\\n      };\\n    };\\n\\n    const blueBase = buildBaseHqAndPad(\'blue\', 0, 22, -6.2, 16.5);\\n    const redBase = buildBaseHqAndPad(\'red\', 0, -22, 6.2, -16.5);\"}], \"TargetFile\":\"/src/game/FactoryPlaygroundCanvas.tsx\", \"toolAction\":\"Refining Base HQ, Stacking Pad positions, and billboard sizes in FactoryPlaygroundCanvas.tsx\", \"toolSummary\":\"Refine Base HQ, Stacking Pad, and billboard sizes\"}"
